<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">1 SHERIANAW</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 SHERIANAW</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sh</para>
  <para style="mt">1 SHERIANAW</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Chronicles</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Sherianaw Uk Kheitnaw</char> te <char style="bk">Uk Ningnaw</char> hynh Samuel ccauh hae te Siapharan ccauh hae kya a ho vae paw kha alunghua bua a ho, tuhzemah muihnaw phuinccang lante nynh a ho. Sherianaw ccauh hae kya Israel siapharan hae phungpaw a zeinaw kyahin eenaw phuin ning a um: (1) Israel te Judah peenaw hae tuh a ro vae hae zemah, Pachia nynh tuh bya a kinpyaku hae paw kha tynsah zah a ccungccaw hae elang a paccynpaw kha Judah ram a um hae paw mangte rya a law mamin. E hae hynh akyh ccaccing cipaw langsaku nawlan David te Solomon cyi khonaw kong thuasah, Jehoshafat, Hezekiah te Josiah nynh cyithuinaw a rae hae paw kong thuasah, Pachia tungvaw mih lungzi hae paw kong thuasah ccawzeitu nynh a langsaku. (2) Jerusalem Beikinn kya Pachia beiknaw athotakawnaw kha thuasah, abyapi lante beiknaw kya ryalahtu hae ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae rya a neekunaw hae kong thuasah, Solomon tuh beikinn a saktu athua zemah a thotakawtu tuh David nynh thua cipaw kong a ho.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Thokeinaw te min ccazing hae 1.1—9.44</para>
  <para style="io1">Saul chinaw 10.1-14</para>
  <para style="io1">David uknaw 11.1—29.30</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Vawsawnaw te taenaw 11.1—22.1</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Beikinn sak lan paccynkunaw 22.2—29.30</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Adam kyate Abraham cia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Gen 5.1-32</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10.1-32</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11.10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Adam, Seth, Enosh, <verse number="2" style="v" />Kenan, Mahalalel Jared, <verse number="3" style="v" />Enok, Methuselah, Lamek, <verse number="4" style="v" />Noah, Shem, Ham te Jafeth.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jafeth ciihan hae tuh: Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshek te Tiras. <verse number="6" style="v" />Gomer ciihan hae tuh: Ashkenaz, Rifath, te Togarmah. <verse number="7" style="v" />Javan ciihan hae tuh: Elishah, Tarshish, Kittim te Rodanim.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ham ciihan hae tuh: Kush, Izip, Put te Kanaan. <verse number="9" style="v" />Kush ciihan hae tuh: Seba, Havilah, Sabta, Raama te Sabteka. Raamah ciihan hae tuh: Sheba te Dedan. <verse number="10" style="v" />Kush tuh Nimrod paaw thua zah, laephi vawlan masaty a thawsae huapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izip tuh Lud, Anam, Lehab, Naftuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathrus, Kasluh (Filistin hae thokeinaw) te Kaftor ccungccaw hae mih paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kanaan tuh a ccatawccaw Sidon, Heth, <verse number="14" style="v" />Jebus hae, Amor hae, Girgash hae, <verse number="15" style="v" />Hiv hae, Arki hae, Sin hae, <verse number="16" style="v" />Arvad hae, Zemari hae te Hamath hae mih paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Shem ciihan hae tuh: Elam, Asshur, Arpakshad, Lud, Aram, Uz, Hul, Gether te Meshek. <verse number="18" style="v" />Arpakshad tuh Shelah paaw thua zah Shelah tuh Eber paaw nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Eber nynh ccapaw lu ning a saah: lu kheit min tuh Peleg nynh thua (pawccecize aning she lyakhe laephi vaw e ccungccaw hae tuh a phiakuh hae), a neitaw min tuh Joktan nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Joktan tuh Almodad, Shelef, Hazarmaveth, Jerah, <verse number="21" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah, <verse number="22" style="v" />Ebal, Abimael, Sheba, <verse number="23" style="v" />Ofir, Havilah te Jobab paaw nynh thua; e hae balyn hynh Joktan ciihan hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Shem kyate Abraham cia: Shem, Arpakshad, Shelah; <verse number="25" style="v" />Eber, Peleg, Reu, <verse number="26" style="v" />Serug, Nahor, Terah te <verse number="27" style="v" />Abram, tuh-e tuh Abraham nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Abraham kyate Jakob cia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Gen 25.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Abraham ccapaw hae tuh: Isak te Ishmael. <verse number="29" style="v" />E hae hynh mih ciihan hae nynh thua: Ishmael a ccatawccaw tuh Nebaioth nynh thua; te Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam, <verse number="30" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa, Hadad, Tema, <verse number="31" style="v" />Jetur, Nafish te Kedemah. E hae nynh Ishmael ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Abraham a lovaenung Keturah ccapaw hae tuh: Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak te Shuah. Jokshan ccapaw hae tuh: Sheba te Dedan. <verse number="33" style="v" />Midian ccapaw hae tuh: Efah, Efer, Hanok, Abida te Eldaah. E hae balyn tuh Keturah ciihan hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Abaraham tuh Isak paaw nynh thua. Isak ccapaw hae tuh: Esau te Israel. <verse number="35" style="v" />Esau ccapaw hae tuh: Elifaz, Reuel, Jeush, Jalam te Korah. <verse number="36" style="v" />Elifaz ccapaw hae tuh: Teman, Omar, Zefi, Gatam, Kenaz, Timna te Amalek. <verse number="37" style="v" />Reuel ccapaw hae tuh: Nahath, Zerah, Shammah te Mizzah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Seir ccapaw hae tuh: Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah, Dishon, Ezer te Dishan. <verse number="39" style="v" />Lotan ccapaw hae tuh: Hori te Homam; Lotan ccianung tuh Timna nynh thua. <verse number="40" style="v" />Shobal ccapaw hae tuh: Alian, Manahath, Ebal, Shefi te Onam. Zibeon ccapaw hae tuh: Aiah te Anah. <verse number="41" style="v" />Anah ccapaw tuh: Dishon. Dishon ccapaw hae tuh: Hamran, Eshban, Ithran te Kheran. <verse number="42" style="v" />Ezer ccapaw hae tuh: Bilhan, Zaavan te Jaakan. Dishan ccapaw hae tuh: Uz te Aran.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Israel hae a uktu siapharan a la um mawze Edom ram a uktu siapharan hae tuh: Beor ccapaw Bela thua zah, a khua min tuh Dinhabah acikuh. <verse number="44" style="v" />Bela a chih te, Bozrah ccapaw Zerah a ccapaw Jobab nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="45" style="v" />Jobab a chih te, Teman hae ram e Husham nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="46" style="v" />Husham a chih te, Moab ram e Midian hae a taetu Bedad ccapaw Hadad tuh siapharan lang a tang; a khua min tuh Avith nynh thua. <verse number="47" style="v" />Hadad a chih te, Masrekah khuapaw Samlah nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="48" style="v" />Samlah a chih te, Zufrates vaw kin umpaw Rehoboth khuapaw Shaul nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="49" style="v" />Shaul a chih te, Akhbor ccapaw Baalhanan nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="50" style="v" />Baalhanan a chih te, Hadad nynh siapharan lang a tang; a khua min tuh Pai acikuh, a zu min tuh Mehetabel cikuh zah Matred ccanung nynh thua, Matred tuh Mezahab ccanung nynh thua. <verse number="51" style="v" />Hadad tuh a chih.</para>
  <para style="p">Edom ram e bawi hae tuh: Timna, Aliah, Jetheth, <verse number="52" style="v" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon, <verse number="53" style="v" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, <verse number="54" style="v" />Magdiel te Iram nynh thua hae; e hae hynh Edom bawi hae nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Israel Ccapaw hae te Judah Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel ccapaw hae tuh: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issakhar, Zebulun, <verse number="2" style="v" />Dan, Josef, Benjamin, Naftali, Gad te Asher. <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah ccapaw hae tuh: Er, Onan te Shelah; e lu thum hae hynh Kanaan nopinung Bathshua nynh a saahpya hae paw nynh thua. Judah a ccatawccaw Er tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> muihnaw kya ccungccaw hoyleipaw thua zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh phe a chia. <verse number="4" style="v" />A monung Tamar nynh mah Perez te Zerah kha a saahpya hae. Judah tuh abalynte ccapaw lu pangaw a hoi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Perez ccapaw hae tuh: Hezron te Hamul. <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerah ccapaw hae tuh: Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Kalkol te Dara, mih balynte lu pangaw. <verse number="7" style="v" />Zerah ciihan Karmi ccapaw hae tuh: Israel kha vawsaw a pyatu, thyaasah athuapaw uccaw tungvaw a seitupaw Akhan kha nynh thua;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Jos 7.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Ethan ccapaw tuh Azariah nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hezron nynh a saahkupaw a ccapaw hae tuh: Jerahmeel, Ram te Khelubai. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ram tuh Amminadab paaw nynh thua, Amminadab tuh Judah ccapaw hae mih bawipaw Nahshon a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Nahshon tuh Salma paaw, Salma tuh Boaz paaw, <verse number="12" style="v" />Boaz tuh Obed paaw, Obed tuh Jesse paaw nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Jesse tuh a ccatawccaw Eliab, lu ningnaw Abinadab, lu thumnaw Shimea, <verse number="14" style="v" />lu palinaw Nethanel, lu pangawnaw Raddai, <verse number="15" style="v" />lu taruhnaw Ozem te lu sarinaw David hae mih paaw nynh thua; <verse number="16" style="v" />mih ccianung hae tuh Zeruiah te Abigail nynh thua hae. Zeruiah ccapaw hae tuh: Abishai, Joab te Asahel, lu thum acih hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Abigail nynh Amasa kha saah zah, Amasa paaw tuh Ishmael ccungccaw Jether nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hezron ccapaw Kaleb nynh a zu Azubah te Jerioth kya a saahpaw ccapaw hae tuh: Jesher, Shobab te Ardon. <verse number="19" style="v" />Azubah he a chih te, Kaleb nynh Efrath kha zu lang hoi zah, aning nynh Hur kha a saahpya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Hur tuh Uri paaw thua zah, Uri tuh Bezalel paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukoute Hezron nynh kum sung taruh acih te, Gilead paaw Makhir a ccanung kha zu lang hoi zah, tuh-e nung nynh Segub kha a saahpya; <verse number="22" style="v" />Segub tuh Jair paaw thua zah, Jair nynh Gilead ram kya khua kuin lae thum a hoi. <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuasalama Geshur te Aram nynh Havothjair khua, Kenath khua te a khua taraw hae sung taruh kha a lua hae. E hae balyn hynh Gilead paaw Makhir ciihan hae nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Hezron tuh Kaleb-efrathah khua kya a chih koute a zu Abijah nynh Ashhur kha a saahpya, Ashhur tuh Tekoa a paaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hezron a ccatawccaw Jerahmeel ccapaw hae tuh: a ccatawccaw Ram, Bunah, Oren, Ozem te Ahijah. <verse number="26" style="v" />Jerahmeel nynh Atarah cikuhpaw ccangpaw zu kha mah a hoi; aning tuh Onam a nung nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerahmeel a ccatawccaw Ram ccapaw hae tuh: Maaz, Jamin te Eker. <verse number="28" style="v" />Onam ccapaw hae tuh: Shammai te Jada. Shammai ccapaw hae tuh: Nadab te Abishur. <verse number="29" style="v" />Abishur a zu min tuh Abihail thua zah, aning nynh Ahban te Molid kha a saahpya. <verse number="30" style="v" />Nadab ccapaw hae tuh: Seled te Appaim; Seled tuh ccaawsaah leite a chih. <verse number="31" style="v" />Appaim ccapaw tuh Ishi. Ishi ccapaw tuh Sheshan. Sheshan ccapaw tuh Ahlai. <verse number="32" style="v" />Shammai neitaw Jada ccapaw hae tuh: Jether te Jonathan; Jether tuh ccaawsaah leite a chih. <verse number="33" style="v" />Jonathan ccapaw hae tuh: Peleth te Zaza. E hae tuh Jerahmeel ciihan hae nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Sheshan tuh ccapaw saah khyh, ccanung hae rou nynh a saah; Sheshan nynh Izip ccungccaw see lu kheit hoi zah a min tuh Jarha acikuh. <verse number="35" style="v" />Sheshan nynh a ccanung kha a seepaw Jarha te umsakheih hae zah, aning nynh Attai kha a saahpya. <verse number="36" style="v" />Attai tuh Nathan a paaw, Nathan tuh Zabad a paaw. <verse number="37" style="v" />Zabad tuh Eflal a paaw, Eflal tuh Obed a paaw. <verse number="38" style="v" />Obed tuh Jehu a paaw, Jehu tuh Azariah a paaw. <verse number="39" style="v" />Azariah tuh Helez a paaw, Helez tuh Eleasah a paaw. <verse number="40" style="v" />Eleasah tuh Sismai a paaw, Sismai tuh Shallum a paaw. <verse number="41" style="v" />Shallum tuh Jekamiah a paaw, Jekamiah tuh Elishama a paaw.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Jerahmeel neitaw Kaleb ccapaw hae tuh: a ccatawccaw Mesha, aning tuh Zif a paaw nynh thua. Zif tuh Mareshah a paaw, Mareshah tuh Hebron a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="43" style="v" />Hebron ccapaw hae tuh: Korah, Tappuah, Rekem te Shema. <verse number="44" style="v" />Shema tuh Raham a paaw, Raham tuh Jorkeam a paaw thua zah, Rekem tuh Shammai a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="45" style="v" />Shammai ccapaw tuh Maon thua zah, Maon tuh Beth-zur a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="46" style="v" />Kaleb lovaenung Efah nynh mah Haran, Moza te Gazez kha a saah hae; Haran tuh Gazez a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="47" style="v" />Jahdai ccapaw hae tuh: Regem, Jotham, Geshan, Pelet, Ephah, te Shaaf. <verse number="48" style="v" />Kaleb lovaenung Maakah nynh Sheber te Tirhanah kha a saah hae. <verse number="49" style="v" />Madmannah paaw Shaaf te Makbenah te Gibea paaw Sheva kha mah a saah hae; Kaleb ccanung tuh Akhsah nynh thua. <verse number="50" style="v" />E hae hynh Kaleb ciihan hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">A zu Efratah te a saah hae paw ccatawccaw Hur a ccapaw hae tuh: Kiriath-jearim a paaw Shobal, <verse number="51" style="v" />Bethlehem a paaw Salma te Beth-gader a paaw Haref. <verse number="52" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim a paaw Shobal nynh a saahpaw ccangpaw ccapaw hae tuh: Haroeh te Menuhoth ccungccaw hae angankuh. <verse number="53" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim kya um hae paw innbyn hae tuh: Ithra ccungccaw hae, Puth ccungccaw hae, Shumath ccungccaw hae te Mishrai ccungccaw hae nynh thua; e hae tuh Zorah ccungccaw hae te Eshtaol ccungccaw hae mih thokeinaw nynh thua. <verse number="54" style="v" />Salma ccapaw hae tuh: Bethlehem, Netofath ccungccaw hae, Atroth-beth-joab ccungccaw hae, Manahath ccungccaw hae angankuh, Zor ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="55" style="v" />Jabez khua kya um hae paw ccawzeithya hae paw tuh: Tirath ccungccaw hae, Shimeath ccungccaw hae te Sukath ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae. E hae tuh Rekhab ciihan hae mih paaw Hammath kyate a tho hae paw Ken ccungccaw hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David te Solomon Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E hae tuh David nynh Hebron khua kya a saah hae paw a ccapaw hae nynh thua: a ccatawccaw Amnon kha Jezreel khuanung Ahinoam nynh a saahpya; lu ningnaw tuh Daniel thua zah Karmel khuanung Abigail nynh a saahpya; <verse number="2" style="v" />lu thumnaw tuh Absalom thua zah Geshur siapharan Talmai ccanung Maakah nynh a saahpya; lu palinaw tuh Adonijah thua zah a nung tuh Haggith nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />lu pangawnaw tuh Shefatiah thua zah Abital nynh a saahpya; lu taruhnaw tuh Ithream thua zah, a zu Eglah nynh a saahpya; <verse number="4" style="v" />lu taruh tuh Hebron khua kya a saah hae, tuin khua kya kum sari te sah taruh ram a uk. Jerusalem khua kyate sung thum kum thum ram a uk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2Sa 5.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 2:11">1Si 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:27">1Sh 29.27</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Ammiel ccanung Bathshua nynh Jerusalem khua kya a saahpyapaw a ccapaw hae lu pali tuh:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3">2Sa 11.3</ref></char></note> Shimea, Shobab, Nathan te Solomon nynh thua hae; <verse number="6" style="v" />te ccangpaw a ccapaw hae lu takua tuh: Ibhar, Elishama, Elipelet, <verse number="7" style="v" />Nogah, Nefeg, Jafia, <verse number="8" style="v" />Elishama, Eliada te Elifelet nynh thua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />E hae balyn hynh a lovaenung ccapaw hae hobia leite, David ccapaw hae nynh thua; mih ccianung tuh Tamar nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Solomon ciihan hae tuh: Solomon ccapaw Rehoboam, Rehoboam ccapaw Abijah, Abijah ccapaw Asa, Asa ccapaw Jehoshafat, <verse number="11" style="v" />Jehoshafat ccapaw Joram, Joram ccapaw Ahaziah, Ahaziah ccapaw Joash, <verse number="12" style="v" />Joash ccapaw Amaziah, Amaziah ccapaw Azariah, Azariah ccapaw Jotham, <verse number="13" style="v" />Jotham ccapaw Ahaz, Ahaz ccapaw Hezekiah, Hezekiah ccapaw Manasseh, <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh ccapaw Amon, Amon ccapaw Josiah. <verse number="15" style="v" />Josiah ccapaw hae tuh: ccatawccaw Johanan, lu ningnaw Jehoiakim, lu thumnaw Zedekiah, lu palinaw Shallum. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehoiakim ciihan hae tuh: Jehoiakim ccapaw Jekoniah, Jekoniah ccapaw Zedekiah; <verse number="17" style="v" />rhaw nynh a kyngpaw Jekoniah ccapaw hae tuh: a ccapaw Shealtiel, <verse number="18" style="v" />Malkhiram, Pedaiah, Shenazzar, Jekamiah, Hoshama te Nedabiah; <verse number="19" style="v" />Pedaiah ccapaw hae tuh: Zerubbabel te Shimei; Zerubbabel ccapaw hae tuh: Meshullam te Hananiah; mih ccianung tuh Shelomith; <verse number="20" style="v" />te ccangpaw a ccapaw hae lu pangaw tuh: Hashubah, Ohel, Berekhiah, Hasadiah te Jusshabhesed. <verse number="21" style="v" />Hananiah ccapaw hae tuh: Pelatiah te Jeshaiah; Jeshaiah ccapaw Refaiah, Refaiah ccapaw Arnan, Arnan ccapaw Obadiah, Obadiah ccapaw Shekaniah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Shekaniah ccapaw tuh Shemaiah. Shemaiah ccapaw hae tuh: Hattush, Igal, Bariah, Neariah te Shafat, mih balynte lu taruh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Neariah ccapaw hae tuh: Elioenai, Hizkiah te Azrikam, mih balynte lu thum. <verse number="24" style="v" />Elioenai ccapaw hae tuh: Hodaviah, Eliashib, Pelaiah, Akkub, Johanan, Delaiah te Anani, mih balynte lu sari acih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Judah Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ccapaw hae tuh: Perez, Hezron, Karmi, Hur te Shobal. <verse number="2" style="v" />Shobal ccapaw Reaiah tuh Jahath a paaw thua zah, Jahath tuh Ahumai te Lahad mih paaw nynh thua. E hae tuh Zorah ccungccaw hae innbyn hae nynh thua hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />E hae tuh Etam ccapaw hae nynh thua: Jezreel, Ishma te Idbash; mih ccianung min tuh Hazzelelponi acikuh, <verse number="4" style="v" />Penuel tuh Gedor paaw thua zah, Ezer tuh Hushah paaw nynh thua. E hae tuh Bethlehem a paaw Efrathah a ccatawccaw Hur a ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tekoa a paaw Ashhur tuh zu lu ning hoi zah, Helah te Naarah nynh thua hae; <verse number="6" style="v" />Naarah nynh Ahuzzam, Hefer, Temeni te Haahastari kha a saahpya. E hae tuh Naarah ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Helah ccapaw hae tuh: Zereth, Izhar te Ethnan. <verse number="8" style="v" />Koz tuh Anub, Zobebah te Harum ccapaw Aharhel a innbyn hae mih paaw nynh thua. <verse number="9" style="v" />Jabez tuh a uno hae laeze sawtuanaw a ccouhua; a nung nynh, “Vawsawte ka saah keiccu,” ci zah Jabez cite min a phu. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jabez nynh Israel Pachia kha ko zah, “Nang nynh hythua yn pya lah, ka ramri kha kosah tua; na kuih nynh yn umkhae sah lah, ccinaw te vawsawnaw kyate yn thungkhawtua!” a ci. Te a ngiapaw kha Pachia nynh a pya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Shuhah a unopaw Khelub tuh Mehir a paaw thua zah, aning tuh Eshton a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="12" style="v" />Eshton tuh Bethrapa, Paseah te Tehinnah mih paaw thua zah, Tehinnah tuh Ir-nahash a paaw nynh thua. E hae tuh Rekah ccungccaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kenaz ccapaw hae tuh: Othniel te Seraiah; Othniel ccapaw hae tuh: Hathath te Meonothai. <verse number="14" style="v" />Monothai tuh Ofrah paaw nynh thua; Seraiah tuh Geharashim hae mih paaw Joab a paaw nynh thua, minmin tuh kuihhae hoypaw thua hae zah Geharashim cite a ko hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb a ccapaw hae tuh: Iru, Elah te Naam; te Elah ccapaw tuh Kenaz. <verse number="16" style="v" />Jehallelel ccapaw hae tuh: Zif, Zifah, Tiria te Asarel. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ezrah ccapaw hae tuh: Jether, Mered, Efer te Jalon. E hae tuh Mered nynh zu lang a hoipaw Faro ccanung Bithiah ccapaw hae nynh thua; te ccaawpoi zah Miriam, Shammai te Ishbah kha a saah hae, Ishbah tuh Eshtemoa a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te a zu Judah nopinung nynh Gedor a paaw Jered, Soko a paaw Heber te Zanoah a paaw Jekuthiel kha a saah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Naham ccianung, Hodiah zu a ccapaw hae tuh Garm ccungccaw Keilah a paaw te Maakath ccungccaw Eshtemoa a paaw nynh thua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Shimon ccapaw hae tuh: Amnon, Rinnah, Benhanan, te Tilon. Ishi ccapaw hae tuh: Zoheth te Benzoheth. <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah ccapaw Shelah a ccapaw hae tuh: Lekah a paaw Er, Mareshah a paaw Laadah te Beth-ashbea khua kya boeikua kua hae paw phin hae, <verse number="22" style="v" />Jokim te Kozeba, Joash te Saraf ccungccaw, Moab nopinung kha zu lang hoikuh zah Lehem khua lang a ki hae paw kha nynh athua hae (atu tuh a la zei hae paw ccaw tuh aryn vae). <verse number="23" style="v" />E hae tuh ang raetu hae te Netaim te Gederah kya a um hae paw nynh thua hae; tuin kyakhe siapharan ryte um hae zah a rya a lawpah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Simeon Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simeon ccapaw hae tuh: Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zerah te Shaul; <verse number="25" style="v" />Shaul ccapaw Shallum, Shallum ccapaw Mibsam, Mibsam ccapaw Mishma. <verse number="26" style="v" />Mishma ccapaw hae tuh: Mishma ccapaw Hammuel, Hammuel ccapaw Zakkur, Zakkur ccapaw Shimei. <verse number="27" style="v" />Shimei nynh ccapaw lu haw lae taruh te ccanung lu taruh a saah; thuasalama a uno hae tuh ccaaw patae saah khyh hae, mih innbyn balyn tuh Judah hae hawte pungzae khyh hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin tuh Beersheba, Moladah, Hazar-shual,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.28-33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:2-8">Jos 19.2-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />Bilhah, Ezem, Tolad, <verse number="30" style="v" />Bethuel, Hormah, Ziklag, <verse number="31" style="v" />Beth-markaboth, Hazar-susim, Beth-biri te Shaaraim khua hae kya a um hae. David tuh siapharan lang a tang cia hynh-e khua hae hynh mih khua hae nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Mih khua taraw hae tuh: Etam, Ain, Rimmon, Tokhen te Ashan, khua pangaw te <verse number="33" style="v" />mih khua hae pepan umpaw khua taraw hae balyn ryte Baal khua kyacia a pee hae. E hae hynh mih khuasahnaw hmin thua zah, mih thokeinaw ccaw kha a ccyku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Meshobab, Jamlek, Amaziah ccapaw Joshah, <verse number="35" style="v" />Joel, Jehu tuh Joshibiah ccapaw, Joshibiah tuh Seraiah ccapaw, Seraiah tuh Asiel ccapaw, <verse number="36" style="v" />Elioenai, Jaakobah, Jeshohaiah, Asaiah, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaiah, <verse number="37" style="v" />Shifi ccapaw Ziza, Shifi tuh Allon ccapaw, Allon tuh Jedaiah ccapaw, Jedaiah tuh Shimri ccapaw, Shimri tuh Shemaiah ccapaw— <verse number="38" style="v" />e mih min te langsahkupaw ccungccaw hae hynh mih puizia hae kya cciakhaetu hae thua zah, mih phin tuh myarya a pungthung. <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin nynh Gedor lang teenaw kalan, accya nithua langkhe mih sahiin hae rampaeekunaw hmin ccung khylan a cceih hae, <verse number="40" style="v" />tuin kyakhe ramnonaw, sahiin rampaeekunaw ahoypaw kha a muih hae, ram tuh myarya kopaw, adaepaw te ngaengan umpaw ram nynh thua; pawccecize langmawlya tuin kya a la um hae paw tuh Ham ciihan hae nynh thua. <verse number="41" style="v" />Mih min te zeipaw hynh-e hae hynh Judah siapharan Hezekiah she lyakhe cceih hae zah, tuin ram a la um hae paw kya-e mih bu hae kha ropah hae zah Meunim ccungccaw hae kha a tuk hae, minmin kha atunin cia maemih hae zah mih umnaw hmin kya a um hae, pawccecize tuin kyakhe mih sahiin hae elang rampaeekunaw a um. <verse number="42" style="v" />Minmin laku e beihtaraw, Simeon phin hae za pangaw tuh Seir Mua lang cceih hae zah, cciakhaetu lupi hae tuh Ishi ccapaw hae Pelatiah, Neariah, Refaiah te Uzziel nynh thua hae; <verse number="43" style="v" />minmin nynh a lue hae paw Amalek hae a laehy hae paw kha roh hae zah, tuin kya atunin cia a um hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Reuben Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel a ccatawccaw Reuben ccapaw hae (aning tuh ccatawccaw athua zemah a paaw ikhung kha a thusah keiccuze ccatawccaw thuanaw kha Israel ccapaw Josef a ccapaw hae kha pya athua, tukeiccuze sherianaw ccazing kya aning kha ccatawccaw a thuanaw thyhte zei thua khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:22">Gen 35.22</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 49:3-4">49.3-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah tuh a uno hae lakuze athungpaw ccungccaw thua zah amaw kyate uktu bawi a langku zemah, ccatawccaw thuanaw kha tuh Josef kya-e nynh thua.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:8-10">Gen 49.8-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel a ccatawccaw Reuben ccapaw hae tuh: Hanok, Pallu, Hezron te Karmi. <verse number="4" style="v" />Joel ccapaw hae tuh: Joel ccapaw Shemaiah, Shemaiah ccapaw Gog, Gog ccapaw Shimei, <verse number="5" style="v" />Shimei ccapaw Mikah, Mikah ccapaw Reaiah, Reaiah ccapaw Baal, <verse number="6" style="v" />Baal ccapaw tuh Assiria siapharan Tilgath-pilneser nynh kyng zah a cciakhaepaw Beerah nynh thua; aning tuh Reuben phin cciakhaetu lupi nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2Si 15.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Te a puizia hae tuh mih innbyn raveih thyhte, mih she raveih sherianaw kha hynhte zei athua: lupi hae, Jeiel te Zekhariah, <verse number="8" style="v" />Azaz ccapaw Bela, Azaz tuh shema ccapaw, Shema tuh Joel ccapaw nynh thua, minmin tuh Aroer khua kyate Nebo te Baal-meon khua kyacia a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Nithua lang Zufrates vaw hynhlang raw laesia ram athotakawnaw kyacia a um hae, pawccecize Gilead ram kya mih sahiin hae tuh myarya a pungthung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul she lyakhe Hagrit ccungccaw hae kha dou hae zah tuh-e hae tuh mih kuih te a chia hae; te Gilead ram nithua lang e ram hae balyn kyakhe mih bu hae kya khua a sah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gad Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gad ccapaw hae tuh Bashan ram lungkhu Salekah khua kyacia, Reuben phin hae pe khe a um hae: <verse number="12" style="v" />Joel tuh lupi thua zah Shafam tuh lu ningnaw nynh thua, te Bashan ram kya Janai te Shafat tuh lupi nynh thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Mih phin thyhte mih puizia hae tuh: Mikhael, Meshullam, Sheba, Jorai, Jakan, Zia te Eber, lu sari acih hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />E hae tuh Abihail ccapaw hae nynh thua; Abihail tuh Huri ccapaw, Huri tuh Jaroah ccapaw, Jaroah tuh Gilead ccapaw, Gilead tuh Mikhael ccapaw, Mikhael tuh Jeshishai ccapaw, Jeshishai tuh Jahdo ccapaw, Jahdo tuh Buz ccapaw; <verse number="15" style="v" />Guni ccapaw Abdiel a ccapaw Ahi tuh mimaw phin kya lupi nynh thua; <verse number="16" style="v" />minmin tuh Gilead ram te Bashan ram e khua hae kya te Sharon ram kya sahiin rampaeekunaw hmin hae balyn kyakhe mih ramri thyhte a um hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />E hae balyn hynh Judah siapharan Jotham te Israel siapharan Jeroboam she lyakhe mih thokeinaw thyhte ccazing kya nung athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh hae kyakhe khawriaphua te thaloi ccyngkuh hae zah li kawthyapaw te rhawtuk thyapaw athungpaw rhawkaw hae, rhawtuk lan paccynkute a um hae paw sung pali thong pali za sari sung taruh a um hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin nynh Hagrit hae, Jetur hae, Nafish hae te Nodad hae kha rhaw a tuk hae; <verse number="20" style="v" />minmin nynh bawmnaw he a mue hae te, Hagrit hae te minmin kya um hae paw balyn kha mih kuih kalan pya athua hae, pawccecize rhawtuknaw kyakhe Pachia kha ko hae zah amaw kha a doliaku hae keiccuze a ngia hae paw kha a pya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Minmin nynh mih sahiin hae kha a cciakhaepya hae: mih kalauh thong sung pangaw, tuu cciing ning thong sung pangaw, lann thong ning te ccungccaw cciing kheit kha kyngte a cciakhae hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Rhawtuknaw tuh Pachia kya-e athua keiccuze rhaw hae kha patae a chia hae. Te see lang cciakhae athua mawlaezung hae, tuin ram kya a um hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Manasseh Phin Angankuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Manasseh phin angankuh tuh tuin ram kya a um hae; Bashan kyate Baal-hermon, Senir te Hermon Mua kyacia myarya alung hae. <verse number="24" style="v" />E hae tuh mih phin raveih kya-e lupi hae nynh thua: Efer, Ishi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremiah, Hodaviah te Jahdiel, athungpaw rhawkaw hae, mih minthaan hae paw te mih phin kya-e lupi hae raveih nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuasalama mih minpaaw hae Pachia tungvaw sei hae zah, mih muihnaw kya Pachia nynh a ropaw ram kya-e ccungccaw hae pachia hae kyakhe a ohhuaku hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Israel Pachia nynh Assiria siapharan Pul thinlung te Tilgath-pilneser thinlung kha tuhou hae zah, tuh-e hae nynh Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh hae kha a cciakhae hae, Halah, Habor, Hara te Gozan vaw kalan cciakhae hae zah atunin cia a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:19">2Si 15.19</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 15:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:6">17.6</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Levi Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Levi ccapaw hae tuh: Gershom, Kohath te Merari. <verse number="2" style="v" />Kohath ccapaw hae tuh: Amram, Izhar, Hebron te Uzziel. <verse number="3" style="v" />Amram ccaaw hae tuh: Aaron, Moses te Miriam. Aaron ccapaw hae tuh: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar te Ithamar. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazar tuh Finehas a paaw, Finehas tuh Abishua a paaw, <verse number="5" style="v" />Abishua tuh Bukki a paaw, Bukki tuh Uzzi a paaw, <verse number="6" style="v" />Uzzi tuh Zerahiah a paaw, Zerahiah tuh Meraioth a paaw, <verse number="7" style="v" />Meraioth tuh Amariah a paaw, Amariah tuh Ahitub a paaw, <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahitub tuh Zadok a paaw, Zadok tuh Ahimaaz a paaw, <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahimaaz tuh Azariah a paaw, Azariah tuh Johanan a paaw, <verse number="10" style="v" />Johanan tuh Azariah a paaw (aning tuh Solomon nynh Jerusalem kya a sakpaw inn kya ranpibawi rya a lahpaw nynh thua). <verse number="11" style="v" />Azariah tuh Amariah a paaw, Amariah tuh Ahitub a paaw, <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahitub tuh Zadok a paaw, Zadok tuh Shallum a paaw, <verse number="13" style="v" />Shallum tuh Hilkiah a paaw, Hilkiah tuh Azariah a paaw, <verse number="14" style="v" />Azariah tuh Seraiah a paaw, Seraiah tuh Jehozadak a paaw; <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Judah hae te Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae kha Nebukhadnezzar kuih te seetangnaw kalan he a saw hae te, Jehozadak tuh seetangnaw kalan a cceihbua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi ccapaw hae tuh: Gershom, Kohath te Merari.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.16-19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:16-19">Exo 6.16-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />E hae tuh Gershom ccapaw hae min nynh thua: Libni te Shemei. <verse number="18" style="v" />Kohath ccapaw hae tuh: Amram, Izhar, Hebron te Uzziel. <verse number="19" style="v" />Merari ccapaw hae tuh: Mahli te Mushi. E hae hynh mih minpaaw hae raveih thyhte Levi phin hae nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Gershon ccapaw hae tuh: Gershon ccapaw Libni, Libni ccapaw Jahath, Jahath ccapaw Zimmah, <verse number="21" style="v" />Zimmah ccapaw Joah, Joah ccapaw Iddo, Iddo ccapaw Zerah, Zerah ccapaw Jeatherai. <verse number="22" style="v" />Kohath ccapaw hae tuh: Hohath ccapaw Amminadab, Amminadab ccapaw Korah, Korah ccapaw Assir, <verse number="23" style="v" />Assir ccapaw Elkanah, Elkanah ccapaw Ebiasaf, Ebiasaf ccapaw Assir, <verse number="24" style="v" />Assir ccapaw Tahath, Tahath ccapaw Uriel, Uriel ccapaw Uzziah, Uzziah ccapaw Shaul. <verse number="25" style="v" />Elkanah ccapaw hae tuh: Amasai te Ahimoth, <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahimoth ccapaw Elkanah, Elkanah ccapaw Zofai, Zofai ccapaw Nahath, <verse number="27" style="v" />Nahath ccapaw Eliab, Eliab ccapaw Jeroham, Jeroham ccapaw Elkanah. <verse number="28" style="v" />Samuel ccapaw hae tuh: a ccatawccaw Joel, lu ningnaw tuh Abijah. <verse number="29" style="v" />Merari ccapaw hae tuh: Merari ccapaw Mahli, Mahli ccapaw Libni, Libni ccapaw Shimei, Shimei ccapaw Uzzah, <verse number="30" style="v" />Uzzah ccapaw Shimea, Shimea ccapaw Haggiah, Haggiah ccapaw Asaiah.</para>
  <para style="s1">Tintang Khuathya hae paw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />E hae tuh byakin thingkua kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu nung athua koute, tuin kya hlawsahpaw rya a lahtu lang cite David nynh a nung hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Solomon nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kha Jerusalem khua kya a sak mawlaezung, tungkunaw bu kya-e beikbu malang khe hlawsahpaw rya a lah hae; mih rya kha rulaekute mimaw ccyh thyhte a law hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />E hae tuh ryalahtu hae te mih ccapaw hae nynh thua: Kohath phin hae kyate: hlawsahtu Heman, aning tuh Joel ccapaw, Joel tuh Samuel ccapaw, <verse number="34" style="v" />Samuel tuh Elkanah ccapaw, Elkanah tuh Jeroham ccapaw, Jeroham tuh Eliel ccapaw, Eliel tuh Toah ccapaw, <verse number="35" style="v" />Toah tuh Zuf ccapaw, Zuf tuh Elkanah ccapaw, Elkanah tuh Mahath ccapaw, Mahath tuh Amasai ccapaw, <verse number="36" style="v" />Amasai tuh Elkanah ccapaw, Elkanah tuh Joel ccapaw, Joel tuh Azariah ccapaw, Azariah tuh Zefaniah ccapaw, <verse number="37" style="v" />Zefaniah tuh Tahath ccapaw, Tahath tuh Assir ccapaw, Assir tuh Ebiasaf ccapaw, Ebiasaf tuh Korah ccapaw, <verse number="38" style="v" />Korah tuh Izhar ccapaw, Izhar tuh Kohath ccapaw, Kohath tuh Levi ccapaw, Levi tuh Israel ccapaw; <verse number="39" style="v" />te a ranglang a thadynpaw a unopaw Asaf, Asaf tuh Berekhiah ccapaw, Berekhiah tuh Shimea ccapaw, <verse number="40" style="v" />Shimea tuh Mikhael ccapaw, Mikhael tuh Baaseiah ccapaw, Baaseiah tuh Malkhijah ccapaw, <verse number="41" style="v" />Malkhijah tuh Ethni ccapaw, Ethni tuh Zerah ccapaw, Zerah tuh Adaiah ccapaw, <verse number="42" style="v" />Adaiah tuh Ethan ccapaw, Ethan tuh Zimmah ccapaw, Zimmah tuh Shimei ccapaw, <verse number="43" style="v" />Shimei tuh Jahath ccapaw, Jahath tuh Gershom ccapaw, Gershom tuh Levi ccapaw. <verse number="44" style="v" />Voilang khe mih puizia Merari ccapaw hae a um hae: Ethan, aning tuh Kishi ccapaw, Kishi tuh Abdi ccapaw, Abdi tuh Malluk ccapaw, <verse number="45" style="v" />Malluk tuh Hashabiah ccapaw, Hashabiah tuh Amaziah ccapaw, Amaziah tuh Hilkiah ccapaw nynh thua. <verse number="46" style="v" />Hilkiah tuh Amzi ccapaw, Amzi tuh Bani ccapaw, Bani tuh Shemer ccapaw, <verse number="47" style="v" />Shemer tuh Mahli ccapaw, Mahli tuh Mushi ccapaw, Mushi tuh Merari ccapaw, Merari tuh Levi ccapaw nynh thua; <verse number="48" style="v" />mih uno Levi phin hae tuh Pachia inn kya-e beikbu rya miakaw kha a lawsah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Aaron te a ciihan hae nynh maee-ute silawnawpaw silawhang vawlan te mynkhuhpaw unawpaw silawhang vawlan khe silawnaw kha rae hae zah, hmin thyaa huaccepaw ryalaw balyn kha lawte, Pachia ryalahtu Moses nynh kaw a la pya hae paw balyn thyhte, Israel hae elang seingaethyanaw kha a raepya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />E hae tuh Aaron ccapaw hae nynh thua: Aaron ccapaw Eleazar, Eleazar ccapaw Finehas, Finehas ccapaw Abishua, <verse number="51" style="v" />Abishua ccapaw Bukki, Bukki ccapaw Uzzi, Uzzi ccapaw Zerahiah, <verse number="52" style="v" />Zerahiah ccapaw Meraioth, Meraioth ccapaw Amariah, Amariah ccapaw Ahitub, <verse number="53" style="v" />Ahitub ccapaw Zadok, Zadok ccapaw Ahimaaz nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Levi hae Umnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />E hae tuh mih ramri lungkhu kya mih umnaw raveih thyhte khua a sahnaw hae hmin hae nynh thua: Aaron ciihan Kohath puizia hae nynh ccungthydungte a ccou hae keiccuze, <verse number="55" style="v" />Judah ram kya umpaw Hebron khua te a pepan e sahiin rampaeenaw hmin hae kha a pya hae, <verse number="56" style="v" />thuasalama khuapi pepan e loo hae te khua taraw hae kha tuh Jefunneh ccapaw Kaleb kha a pya hae. <verse number="57" style="v" />Aaron ciihan hae kha khynnaw khua hae a pya hae: Hebron khua, Libnah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Jattir khua, Eshtemoa khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="58" style="v" />Hilen khua te a sahiin rampaeekunaw hae, Debir khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="59" style="v" />Ashan khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Beth-shemesh khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae. <verse number="60" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae ram lungkhu e, Geba khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Alemeth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Anathoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae. Mih puizia hae thyhte mih khua hae balyn tuh khua haw lae thum acih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A laehypaw Kohath ciihan hae nynh ccungthydungte Manasseh phin angankuh lungkhu e, khua khuahaw kha pya athua hae. <verse number="62" style="v" />Gershom ciihan hae nynh mih puizia hae thyhte, Issakhar phin, Asher phin, Naftali phin te Bashan ram e Manasseh phin lungkhu e, khua khuahaw lae thum kha neethung athua hae. <verse number="63" style="v" />Merari ciihan hae kha mih puizia hae thyhte, Reuben phin, Gad phin te Zebulun phin lungkhu e khua khuahaw lae ning kha neethung athua hae. <verse number="64" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel hae nynh Levi phin hae kha khua hae te mih sahiin rampaeenaw hae kha a pya hae. <verse number="65" style="v" />Judah phin, Simeon phin te Benjamin phin lungkhu e kha mah mih min te langsahkupaw hynh-e khua hae hynh ccungthydungte Levi phin hae kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Kohath ciihan kya-e puizia hae abang nynh Efraim phin hae ram lungkhu e khua hae te sahiin rampaeenaw hae kha a ccou hae. <verse number="67" style="v" />Khynnaw khua hae kha minmin kalan a pya hae: Efraim muaram kya umpaw Shekhem khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Gezer khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="68" style="v" />Jokmeam khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Beth-horon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="69" style="v" />Aijalon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Gath-rimmon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae; <verse number="70" style="v" />Manasseh phin angankuh hae ram lungkhu e kha Aner khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Bileam khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae kha a laehypaw Kohath ciihan hae hanlan a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Gershom ciihan hae hanlan a pya hae paw tuh: Manasseh phin angankuh hae ram lungkhu e, Bashan ram e Golan khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae te Ashtaroth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae; <verse number="72" style="v" />Issakhar phin hae ram lungkhu e, Kedesh khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Daberath khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="73" style="v" />Ramoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Anem khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae; <verse number="74" style="v" />Asher phin hae ram lungkhu e, Mashal khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Abdon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="75" style="v" />Hukok khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Rehob khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae; <verse number="76" style="v" />Naftali phin hae ram lungkhu e, Galilee ram kya umpaw Kedesh khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Hammon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Kiriathaim khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae kha a pya hae. <verse number="77" style="v" />A laehypaw Merari ciihan hae hanlan kha, Zebulun phin hae ram lungkhu e, Rimmono khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Tabor khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="78" style="v" />Jeriko khua kyate Jordan vaw khuraw lang, Jordan vaw nithua lang raw kya, Reuben phin hae ram lungkhu e, ramkaw umpaw Bezer khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Jahzah khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="79" style="v" />Kedemoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Mefaath khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae; <verse number="80" style="v" />Gad phin hae ram lungkhu e, Gilead ram kya umpaw Ramoth khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, Mahanaim khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae, <verse number="81" style="v" />Heshbon khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae te Jazer khua te a sahiin hae rampaeenaw hae kha a pya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Issakhar Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Issakhar ccapaw hae tuh: Tola, Puah, Jashub te Shimron, lu pali acih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tola ccapaw hae tuh: Uzzi, Refaiah, Jeriel, Jahmai, Ibsam te Shemuel nynh thua hae, e hae tuh mih minpaaw Tola ciihan hae lungkhu e lupi hae nynh thua, minmin she lyaze athungpaw rhawkaw hae thua hae zah, David she lyakhe thong kuin lae ning za taruh acih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Uzzi ccapaw tuh: Izrahiah. Izrahiah ccapaw hae tuh: Mikhael, Obadiah, Joel te Isshiah, lu pangaw um hae zah mih balynte lupi hae nynh thua; <verse number="4" style="v" />mih she raveihte, mih minpaaw hae ciihan hae thyhte, rhawtuk khopaw rhawkaw hae sung thum thong taruh a um hae, pawccecize zu hae te ccapaw hae patae a hoi hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Mih puizia Issakhar phin hae balyn kya a um hae paw tuh athungpaw rhawkaw hae thua hae zah, mih thokeinaw ccazing thyhte sung tarya thong sari a um hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Benjamin Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Benjamin ccapaw hae tuh: Bela, Bekher te Jediael, lu thum acih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Bela ccapaw hae tuh: Ezbon, Uzzi, Uzziel, Jerimoth te Iri, lu pangaw acih hae, e hae tuh mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae, athungpaw rhawkaw hae thua hae zah, mih thokeinaw ccazing lawnaw thyhte thong kuin lae ning sung thum lu pali acih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Bekher ccapaw hae tuh; Zemirah, Joash, Eliezer, Elioenai, Omri, Jeremoth, Abijah, Anathoth te Alemeth. E hae balyn tuh Bekher ccapaw hae nynh thua; <verse number="9" style="v" />mih she thyhte mih thokeinaw ccazing lawnaw kya mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae, athungpaw rhawkaw hae tuh thong kuin za ning acih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Jediael ccapaw tuh: Bilhan. Bilhan ccapaw hae tuh: Jeush, Benjamin, Ehud, Khenaanah, Zethan, Tarshish te Ahishahar. <verse number="11" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh Jediael ccapaw hae, mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae, athungpaw rhawkaw hae thua hae zah, rhawtuk lan paccynkute um hae paw thong haw lae sari za ning acih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Te Shuppim te Huppim tuh Ir ccapaw hae thua zah, Aher ccapaw tuh Hushim nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Naftali Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Naftali ccapaw hae tuh: Jahziel, Guni, Jezer te Shallum; Bilhah ciihan hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Manasseh Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Manasseh nynh a lovaenung Aramean nopinung kya ccapaw hae Asriel te Makhir kha a saah hae, Makhir tuh Gilead a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />Makhir nynh Huppim te Shuppim kha zu a dypya hae. A ccianung min tuh Maakah nynh thua. Lu ningnaw min tuh Zelofehad thua zah, Zelofehad nynh ccanung hae kyalya kha a saah. <verse number="16" style="v" />Makhir zu Maakah nynh ccapaw saah zah Peresh cite min a phu; te a neitawpaw min tuh Sheresh nynh thua; a ccapaw hae tuh Ulam te Rekem nynh thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ulam ccapaw tuh Bedan nynh thua. E hae tuh Manasseh ccapaw Makhir a ccapaw Gilead ciihan hae nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />A ccianung Hammolekheth nynh Ishhod, Abiezer te Mahlah kha a saah hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Shemida ccapaw hae tuh: Ahian, Shekhem, Likhi te Aniam nynh thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Efraim Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim ccapaw hae tuh: Efraim ccapaw Shuthelah, Shuthelah ccapaw Bered, Bered ccapaw Tahath, Tahath ccapaw Eleadah, Eleadah ccapaw Tahath, <verse number="21" style="v" />Tahath ccapaw Zabad, Zabad ccapaw Shuthelah. Tuhlaepaw Efraim ccapaw hae tuh Ezer te Elead thua hae zah, minmin nynh ram lungkhu a pui hae paw Gath ccungccaw hae kya-e sahiin hae kha luade khylan a ccianua hae keiccuze tuh-e hae nynh a chia hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Mih paaw Efraim tuh nin patae rawkhuite um zah a uno hae tuh lungtangnaw bya hopya khylan oun cceih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Efraim nynh a zu kha ikhae zah, a zu tuh ccaawpoi zah ccapaw a saah; a innbyn kya hoyleinaw a thua keiccuze a ccapaw kha Beriah cite min a phu. <verse number="24" style="v" />A ccanung tuh Sheerah cikuh zah, aning nynh Alia te Palung Beth-horon khua te Uzzen-sheerah khua kha a rae. <verse number="25" style="v" />A ccapaw tuh Refah, Refah ccapaw Reshef, Reshef ccapaw Telah, Telah ccapaw Tahan, <verse number="26" style="v" />Tahan ccapaw Ladan, Ladan ccapaw Ammihud, Ammihud ccapaw Elishama, <verse number="27" style="v" />Elishama ccapaw Nun, Nun ccapaw Joshua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin nynh a ccou hae paw te mih umnaw tuh Bethel te a pepan e khua hae, nithua lang Naaran te niccaw lang Gezer te a khua taraw hae, Shekhem te a khua taraw hae, Ayyah te a khua taraw hae; <verse number="29" style="v" />te Manasseh phin hae ramri te akyngkuhpaw Beth-shean te a khua taraw hae, Taanak te a khua taraw hae, Megiddo te a khua taraw hae, Dor te a khua hae nynh thua. E khua hae kyakhe Israel ccapaw Josef a ciihan hae a um hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Asher Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Asher ccapaw hae tuh: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah te mih ccianung Serah. <verse number="31" style="v" />Beriah ccapaw hae tuh: Heber te Malkhiel, Malkhiel tuh Birzaith a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Heber tuh Jaflet, Shomer, Hotham te mih ccianung Shua mih paaw nynh thua. <verse number="33" style="v" />Jaflet ccapaw hae tuh: Pasak, Bimhal te Ashvath. E hae hynh Jaflet ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Shemer ccapaw hae tuh: Rohgah, Jehubbah te Aram. <verse number="35" style="v" />A neitawpaw Helem ccapaw hae tuh: Zofah, Imna, Shelesh te Amal. <verse number="36" style="v" />Zofah ccapaw hae tuh: Suah, Harnefer, Shual, Beri, Imrah, <verse number="37" style="v" />Bezer, Hod, Shamma, Shilshah, Ithran te Beera. <verse number="38" style="v" />Jether ccapaw hae tuh: Jefunneh, Pispa te Ara. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ulla ccapaw hae tuh: Arah, Hanniel te Rizia. <verse number="40" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh Asher ccungccaw, mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae, po athuapaw athungpaw rhawkaw hae, bawi hae kya-e lupi hae nynh thua. Mih thokeinaw thyhte ccazing law athuapaw, rhaw a tuk khopaw thong kuin lae taruh acih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Benjamin Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Benjamin tuh a ccatawccaw Bela, lu ningnaw Ashbel, lu thumnaw Aharah, <verse number="2" style="v" />lu palinaw Nohah te lu pangawnaw Rafa nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Bela ccapaw hae tuh: Addar, Gera, Abihud, <verse number="4" style="v" />Abishua, Naaman, Ahoah, <verse number="5" style="v" />Gera, Shefufan te Huram nynh thua hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />E hae tuh Ehud ccapaw hae nynh thua (minmin tuh Geba khua um hae paw puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae thua hae zah, Manahath kya um khylan kyngte cciakhae athua hae): <verse number="7" style="v" />Naaman, Ahijah te Gera, Gera tuh Heglam kha nynh thua, aning tuh Uzza te Ahihud mih paaw nynh thua. <verse number="8" style="v" />Shaharaim nynh a zu hae Hushim te Baara kha ccaring a dee kou hae te Moab ram kya ccapaw hae kha a saah. <verse number="9" style="v" />A zu Hodesh kya a saahpaw ccapaw hae tuh: Jobab, Zibia, Mesha, Malkam, <verse number="10" style="v" />Jeuz, Sakhia te Mirmah. E hae tuh a ccapaw hae thua zah mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />A zu Hushim kya a saahpaw ccapaw hae tuh: Abitub te Elpaal. <verse number="12" style="v" />Elpaal ccapaw hae tuh: Eber, Misham te Shemed thua hae zah, Shemed tuh Ono khua, Lod khua te a pepan e khua hae a raetu nynh thua, <verse number="13" style="v" />Beriah te Shema (minmin tuh Gath khuaccaaw hae kha a deetu hae Aijalon khuaccaaw hae kya puizia hae kya-e lu hae nynh thua); <verse number="14" style="v" />te Ahio, Shashak te Jeremoth nynh thua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Zebadiah, Arad, Eder, <verse number="16" style="v" />Mikhael, Ishpah te Joha tuh Beriah ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Zebadiah, Meshullam, Hizki, Heber, <verse number="18" style="v" />Ishmerai, Izliah, te Jobab tuh Elpaal ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakim, Zikhri, Zabdi, <verse number="20" style="v" />Elienai, Zillethai, Eliel, <verse number="21" style="v" />Adaiah, Beraiah te Shimrath tuh Shimei ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Ishpan, Eber, Eliel, <verse number="23" style="v" />Abdon, Zikhri, Hanan, <verse number="24" style="v" />Hananiah, Elam, Anthothijah, <verse number="25" style="v" />Ifdeiah te Penuel tuh Shashak ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Shamsherai, Shehariah, Athaliah, <verse number="27" style="v" />Jaareshiah, Elijah te Zikhri tuh Jeroham ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />E hae tuh mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae, mih she raveih thyhte lupi hae nynh thua. Minmin tuh Jerusalem khua nynh a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Gibeon a paaw Jeiel tuh Gibeon khua kya um zah a zu tuh Maakah nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />A ccatawccaw tuh Abdon, tukoute Zur, Kish, Baal, Nadab, <verse number="31" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zekher <verse number="32" style="v" />te Mikloth, aning tuh Shimeah a paaw nynh thua. E hae hynh mah Jerusalem kya um hae paw mih puizia hae te arawsekunaw khe mih puizia hae ryte a um hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ner tuh Kish a paaw, Kish tuh Saul a paaw, Saul tuh Jonathan, Malkhishua, Abinadab te Eshbaal mih paaw nynh thua; <verse number="34" style="v" />Jonathan ccapaw tuh Meribbaal nynh thua; Meribbaal tuh Mikah paaw nynh thua. <verse number="35" style="v" />Mikah ccapaw hae tuh: Pithon, Melek, Tarea te Ahaz. <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahaz tuh Jehoaddah a paaw nynh thua; Jehoaddah tuh Alemeth, Azmaveth te Zimri mih paaw nynh thua; Zimri tuh Moza a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="37" style="v" />Moza tuh Binea a paaw nynh thua; Binea ccapaw Rafah, Rafah ccapaw Eleasah, Eleasah ccapaw Azel. <verse number="38" style="v" />Azel nynh ccapaw lu taruh saah zah mih min tuh: Azrikam, Bokheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah te Hanan; e hae balyn tuh Azel ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="39" style="v" />Azel neitawpaw Eshek ccapaw hae tuh: ccatawccaw Ulam, lu ningnaw Jeush te lu thumnaw Elifelet. <verse number="40" style="v" />Ulam ccapaw hae tuh athungpaw rhawkaw hae, thekawthya hae paw nynh thua, ccaaw te mintaw patae hoi hae zah za kheit sung pangaw acih hae. E hae balyn tuh Benjamin phin hae nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel hae balyn tuh mih thokeinaw raveih thyhte ccazing law athua hae; e hae hynh Israel Siapharan hae Ccauh kya zei athua. Te Judah tuh mih lungzi khyh keiccuze kyngte Babilon lang cciakhae athua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />A ccou hae paw khua hae kya masaty a umthui hae paw tuh Israel hae, ranpibawi hae, Levi phin hae te beikinn kya ryalahtu hae nynh thua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2-3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 2:27">Ezr 2.27</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 7:73">Neh 7.73</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Seetangnaw koute Jerusalem Khuaccaaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Judah phin, Benjamin phin, Efraim phin te Manasseh phin hae abang tuh Jerusalem kya a um hae: <verse number="4" style="v" />Ammihud ccapaw Uthai, Ammihud tuh Omri ccapaw, Omri tuh Imri ccapaw, Imri tuh Bani ccapaw, Bani tuh Judah ccapaw Perez a ccapaw hae kyate a thopaw nynh thua. <verse number="5" style="v" />Shilon ciihan hae tuh ccatawccaw Asaiah te a ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Zerah ccapaw hae lungkhu e tuh Jeuel te mih puizia hae thua zah, za taruh sung takua a um hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae lungkhu e tuh Meshullam ccapaw Sallu, Meshullam tuh Hodaviah ccapaw, Hodaviah tuh Hassenuah ccapaw, <verse number="8" style="v" />Jeroham ccapaw Ibneiah, Uzzi ccapaw Elah, Uzzi tuh Mikhri ccapaw te Shefatiah ccapaw Meshullam, Shefatiah tuh Reuel ccapaw, Reuel tuh Ibnijah ccapaw; <verse number="9" style="v" />mih she thyhte mih puizia hae tuh za takua sung pangaw lu taruh acih hae. E hae balyn tuh mih puizia hae thyhte mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae lungkhu e tuh: Jedaiah, Jehoiarib, Jakhin, <verse number="11" style="v" />te Azariah tuh Hilkiah ccapaw, Hilkiah tuh Meshullam ccapaw, Meshullam tuh Zadok ccapaw, Zadok tuh Meraioth ccapaw, Meraioth tuh Ahitub ccapaw, Ahitub tuh Pachia inn kya ale huapaw lupi nynh thua; <verse number="12" style="v" />te Adaiah tuh Jeroham ccapaw, Jeroham tuh Pashhur ccapaw, Pashhur tuh Malkhijah ccapaw, te Maasai tuh Adiel ccapaw, Adiel tuh Jahzerah ccapaw, Jahzerah tuh Meshullam ccapaw, Meshullam tuh Meshillemith ccapaw, Meshillemith tuh Immer ccapaw; <verse number="13" style="v" />a pui hae paw, mih puizia hae kya-e lu hae holeite, thong kheit za sari sung taruh acih hae, minmin tuh Pachia inn ryalawnaw kya ryalah kho hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Levi Phin hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Levi phin hae lungkhu e tuh: Shemaiah tuh Hasshub ccapaw, Hassub tuh Azrikam ccapaw, Azrikam tuh Merari ccapaw hae laku e Hashabiah ccapaw nynh thua; <verse number="15" style="v" />te Bakbakkar, Heresh, Galal te Mattaniah, Mattaniah tuh Mikah ccapaw; Mikah tuh Zikhri ccapaw, Zikhri tuh Asaf ccapaw; <verse number="16" style="v" />te Obadiah tuh Shemaiah ccapaw, Shemaiah tuh Galal ccapaw, Galal tuh Jeduthun ccapaw; te Berekhiah tuh Netofah ccungccaw hae kya-e khua hae kya umpaw Elkanah ccapaw Asa a ccapaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sakoih ngawtu hae tuh: Shallum, Akkub, Talmon, Ahiman; mih puiziapaw Shallum tuh minmin kya lupi nynh thua, <verse number="18" style="v" />minmin tuh nithua lang e siapharan sakoih kyakhe nung athua hae. E hae tuh Levi phin ryahmin hae sakoih a ngawtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Shallum tuh Kore ccapaw, Kore tuh Ebiasaf ccapaw, Ebiasaf tuh Korah ccapaw, te a thokeinaw paaw hae kya-e a puizia hae, Korah phin hae tuh beiknaw ryalaw do-oihnaw kyaze bu thuakaw ngawtu hae nynh thua, mih minpaaw hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ryahmin do-oihnaw kyaze bu teenaw ngawtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="20" style="v" />Langmaw lyaze Eleazar ccapaw Finehas tuh minmin a uktu lupi nynh thua; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh amaw kya a um. <verse number="21" style="v" />Meshelemiah ccapaw Zekhariah tuh tungkunaw bu teenaw kya thuakaw ngawtu nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh teenaw kya thuakaw ngawtu hae thua zah za ning lu haw lae ning acih hae. Mih khua raveih kyakhe mih thokeinaw thyhte ccazing law athua hae; David te muihtu Samuel nynh minmin kha doliakupaw mih ryalaw kyakhe a nung hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tukeiccuze minmin te mih ciihan hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn sakoih hae kha a do-oih hae, tuh-e tuh bu inn thua zah minmin tuh a ngawtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />sakoih ngawtu hae tuh nithua, niccaw, thahlang, deilang, san pali kya a ngaw hae; <verse number="25" style="v" />te mih khua raveih kya um hae paw mih puizia hae tuh nin sari takyhte mimaw ccyh thyhte minmin ryte um lan leih a cceih hae; <verse number="26" style="v" />pawccecize sakoih ngawtu lupi hae lu pali, Levi phin hae nynh Pachia inn lungkhu e akhaan hae te sisuakhaan hae kha a do-oih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Minmin tuh Pachia inn pe khe khuazi leih a rya hae; pawccecize ngawpaw rya te awkhua takyh thuakaw hungpaw rya tuh mih rya nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Minmin laku e abang tuh ryalawnawpaw angphe kha a do-oih hae, pawccecize angphe a teekhae hae te a poukhae hae ze minmin nynh ria lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Minmin laku e abang tuh ccaboi te tungkhung do-oihtu, athyaapaw angphe miakaw do-oihtu, ahoypaw vaekhui do-oihtu, misutui, chitui, mynkhuhpaw te mynkhuhpaw aphuinphuin do-oihtu lang a nung hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Ccangpaw abang, ranpibawi hae ccapaw hae nynh mynkhuhpaw aphuinphuin pydepaw rya kha a law hae, <verse number="31" style="v" />Levi phin kya-e lu kheit, Korah ciihanpaw Shallum a ccatawccaw Mattithiah tuh sanlou phe raenaw kya uktu nynh thua. <verse number="32" style="v" />Kohath ciihan hae kya-e mih puizia hae abang nynh mah sabbath nin takyh hanlan nungpyapaw sanlou kha a paccyn hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />E hae tuh hlawsahtu hae thua hae zah, Levi phin kya-e mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae nynh thua, minmin tuh beikinn lungkhu akhaan hae kyakhe um hae zah khuazi khuadae ryalaw kya umsah athua hae keiccuze ccangpaw ryalahbua khyh hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />E hae tuh mih she raveih thyhte Levi phin kya-e mih puizia raveih kya-e lu hae thua hae zah Jerusalem khua kya a um hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Siapharan Ciihan hae</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">1Sh 8.29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gibeon a paaw Jeiel tuh Gibeon khua kya um zah a zu min tuh Maakah acikuh. <verse number="36" style="v" />A ccatawccaw tuh Abdon, tukoute Zur, Kish, Baal, Ner, Nadab, <verse number="37" style="v" />Gedor, Ahio, Zekhariah te Mikloth; <verse number="38" style="v" />Mikloth tuh Shimeam a paaw nynh thua; e hae hynh mah Jerusalem um hae paw mih puizia hae te ahawiliakunaw khe mih puizia hae ryte a um hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ner tuh Kish a paaw, Kish tuh Saul a paaw, Saul tuh Jonathan, Malkhishua, Abinadab te Eshbaal hae mih paaw: <verse number="40" style="v" />te Jonathan ccapaw tuh Meribbaal thua zah, Meribbaal tuh Mikah a paaw nynh thua. <verse number="41" style="v" />Mikah ccapaw hae tuh: Pithon, Melek, Tahrea te Ahaz; <verse number="42" style="v" />te Ahaz tuh Jarah a paaw, Jarah tuh Alemeth, Azmaveth te Zimri hae mih paaw nynh thua; Zimri tuh Moza a paaw, <verse number="43" style="v" />Moza tuh Binea a paaw; te Binea ccapaw Refaiah, Refaliah ccapaw Eleasah, Eleasah ccapaw Azel. <verse number="44" style="v" />Azel nynh ccapaw lu taruh a saah, tuh-e hae min tuh: Azrikam, Bokheru, Ishmael, Sheariah, Obadiah te Hanan; e hae tuh Azel ccapaw hae nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Saul te A Ccapaw hae Chinaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1Sa 31.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Israel hae kha a tuk hae; Israel hae tuh Filistin hae malang khe ccue hae zah Gilboa Mua vawlan khe patae a chih hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Saul te a ccapaw hae kha phah hae zah, Filistin hae nynh Saul ccapaw hae Jonathan, Abinadab te Malkhishua kha a chia hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Rhawtuknaw kya Saul tuh myarya a teing; thekawthya hae paw nynh maw a muesah hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tetuh Saul nynh a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu kha, “Na thaloi kha thuaakuh lah, kae hynh yn thuing, tuhteze nynh e vingdungawkuh lei hae paw nynh kae hynh ccianuate yn thuing lan khyh hae zah ccyasah nawlan yn mang lan khyh hae,” a cipya. Thuasalama a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh myarya rih zah thuing ry khyh. Tukeiccuze Saul nynh a thaloi kha lawkuh zah thaloi dung kha bakhung thin zah a chih. <verse number="5" style="v" />Saul a chih vae cipaw kha a rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh he a muih tuh, aning nynh mah a thaloi kha bakhung thin zah, Saul kya a chihbua. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuhcite Saul te a ccapaw hae lu thum te a innbyn hae balyn tuh pynkheihlan a chih hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel rhawkaw hae tuh ccue hae zah Saul te a ccapaw hae tuh a chih vae hae cipaw kha accya kya um hae paw Israel hae balyn nynh he a thae hae tuh, mih khua hae kha poutaw hae zah a ccue hae; te Filistin hae nynh ccianua hae zah khua hae kha a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Awkhualan khe, Filistin hae nynh michi hae uccaw kha khahku lan he oun thua hae tuh, Gilboa Mua vawlan a chih hae paw Saul te a ccapaw hae kha a muih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Saul lu kha pae hae zah a rhawtuk-uccaw kha a khah hae, te mih zohtuh hae kalan te ccungccaw hae kalan thongpang hoypaw ho khylan, locceihtu hae kha Filistin ram phe lekuh lan a saw hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Saul a rhawtuk-uccaw kha mih pachia hae beikinn kya a nung hae; a lu kha Dagon beikinn kya a sae hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh Saul tungvaw a cyisahnaw hae atyn-are kha Jabesh-gilead khuaccaaw hae balyn nynh he a thae hae tuh, <verse number="12" style="v" />mih rawthung hae paw balyn nynh thonuakuh hae zah Saul rhua te a ccapaw hae rhua kha lah hae zah Jabesh khua lang a cciakhae hae. Te mih ru kha Jabesh khua e phaesi ku kaw khe a uu hae, te nin sari looh-ae a sung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuhcite Saul tuh a lungzi khyh keiccuze a chih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tungvaw a lungzi khyh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kawbya kha zui khyh; tuhpiaze chihiinleihthyanung kha tuanaw ngiakute a bya kha zui ry zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19.31</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 20:6">20.6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 13:8-14">1Sa 13.8-14</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 15:1-24">15.1-24</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 28:7-8">28.7-8</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha tuanaw ngiakuh khyh. Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh theih zah peenaw kha Jesse ccapaw David kalan a pya.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David kha Siapharan lang Chitui Thuhnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2Sa 5.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel phin hae balyn nynh Hebron khua umpaw David kalan pynkheihlan oun thua hae zah, “Dotua, kaening tuh na ru te na saw nynh kae thua. <verse number="2" style="v" />Alia vae paw ccyh kya, Saul nynh siapharan lang oun tangpya lya heize, Israel rhawkaw hae kaw a pyatu tuh namaw nynh na thua. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha ae hopah zah: Nang tuh ka ccungccaw Israel hae tuurin na thua cih zah, ka ccungccaw Israel hae uktu na thua cih, ae cipya,” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel piccan hae balyn tuh Hebron khua umpaw siapharan kalan a thua hae; David nynh Hebron khua <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe minmin ryte byakinnaw a rae. Samuel kyate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya yn thua thyhte, David kha Israel siapharan lang chitui a thuh hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem Lawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />David te Israel hae balyn tuh Jerusalem khua lang a cceih hae, tuh-e khua tuh Jebus khua thua zah tuin ram kya um hae paw Jebus hae nynh tuin khua kya a um hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Jos 15.63</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 1:21">Bpt 1.21</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Jebus khuaccaaw hae nynh David kha, “Hynhlang nae tee lan khyh,” a cipya hae. Thuasalama atu David khua a ci hae paw Zion rhawlungrua kha David nynh a law. <verse number="6" style="v" />David nynh, “Jebus ccungccaw hae kha masaty a tukpaw tuh rhawbawi lehuapaw athua cih,” a ci. Zeruiah ccapaw Joab nynh masaty a ccia keiccuze aning tuh rhawbawi lehuapaw lang a tang. <verse number="7" style="v" />David tuh rhawlungrua lungkhu a um keiccuze tuh-e tuh David khua a ci hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />David nynh khua kha po voilu lan, Millo kyate tho zah marya akoihkuh lante a rae; khua kya-e tuhlaepaw kha tuh Joab nynh a raethui. <verse number="9" style="v" />Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh David kya a um keiccuze aning tuh houhouh a lesae.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Ccungccaw A Thung hae paw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2Sa 23.8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />E hae tuh David rhawkaw athung hae paw kya-e lupi hae nynh thua, Israel te asekuh lante <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte, amaw kha siapharan lang khang khylan minmin nynh a peenaw kyakhe Israel hae balyn ryte pynkheihlan thawte a bawm hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />E hynh David rhawkaw athung hae paw konglang nynh thua: Hakhmon ccapaw Jashobeam tuh Lu Thum hae kyaze lupi nynh thua; aning nynh a ccoi ccyngkute ccungccaw za thum kha vae kheit te a chia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Te lu thum hae laku kya tuh-e paw koute he a zuipaw tuh Ahohi ccungccaw Dodo a ccapaw Eleazar nynh thua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh rhawtuk khylan Pas-dammim kya a sueluaku lya hae ze, aning tuh David ryte a umkheih hae. Barli phe abeihpaw loo ccyngkheit a um. Ccungccaw hae tuh Filistin hae kyate a ccue hae, <verse number="14" style="v" />thuasalama David te aning tuh loo ngaelung kya thadynnaw hmin lawkuh hae zah tuh-e hmin kyate Filistin hae kha a chia hae; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh taenaw lepaw te a khum hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cciakhaetu hae sung thum kya-e lu thum tuh Adullam lungkarung kya umpaw David kalan a cceih hae, tuh lyatuin Filistin rhawkaw hae tuh Refaim accya kya a rya hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />David tuh rhawlungrua lungkhu um zah, Filistin hae rhawviatu rhawkaw hae tuh Bethlehem kya a um hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />David nynh , “Lukhakheit nynh koikua pe umpaw Bethlehem tuisung kya-e tui kha nia lan yn pya ravo nyn!” cite lungdeite a ho. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh athungpaw lu thum hae nynh Filistin hae ryahmin kha roh hae zah koikua pe umpaw Bethlehem tuisung kya-e tui kha the hae zah David kalan a cciakhae hae. Thuasalama David nynh nia leite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe moh lae zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />“E tui hynh ka nia khyh nawlan ka Pachia nynh yn khee vae sah. E ccungccaw hae chiise hynh ka neih kho cih zawtou? Pawccecize ka chi ze ka chih cite cceih hae zah, e tui hynh oun thuakhae hae,” a ci. Tukeiccuze aning nynh neih khyh. Tuh-e rhawkaw hae lu thum nynh tuhcite rya a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Joab neitaw Zeruiah a ccapaw Abishai tuh Ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kyaze lupi nynh thua. A ccoi te ccungccaw za thum kha tuk hae zah a chia hae keiccuze Lu Thum hae kya a minthaanbua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning tuh Ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kyaze a minthaan huaccepaw thua zah mih rhawbawipaw lang a tang; thuasalama Lu Thum hae hawte tuh a minthaan khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kabzeel khuapaw Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah tuh arawthungpaw ccungccaw thua zah, ryalaw lepaw a lahpaw nynh thua; Moab ccungccaw Ariel ccapaw hae lu ning kha a chia hae. Vuiraw accaw nin khe cceih zah laekarung lungkhu umpaw chindeih kha a chia. <verse number="23" style="v" />Izip ccungccaw dong pangaw ahangpaw, a pynrua hoypaw kha a chia. Izip paw tuh a kuih kya phaeccya cia acihpaw ccoi a hoi; thuasalama Benaiah nynh hoitang ccyngkute ccianua zah, Izip paw kuih kya-e ccoi kha a lua koute amaw ccoi toulou maw te a chia. <verse number="24" style="v" />Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh tuhcite cyih zah athungpaw lu thum hae kya a minthaanbua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Aning tuh ccungccaw Sung Thum hae kya a minthaanbua, thuasalama Lu Thum hae hawte tuh a minthaan khyh. David nynh amaw a rhawviatu hae lupi lang a nung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Rhawkaw hae kyaze mih rawthung hae paw tuh, Joab neitaw Asahel, Bethlehem khuapaw Dodo ccapaw Elhanan, <verse number="27" style="v" />Harod khuapaw Shammah, Pelon ccungccaw Helez, <verse number="28" style="v" />Tekoa khuapaw Ikkesh a ccapaw Ira, Anathoth khuapaw Abeizer, <verse number="29" style="v" />Hushath ccungccaw Sibbekai, Ahoh ccungccaw Ilai, <verse number="30" style="v" />Netofah khuapaw Maharai, Netofah khuapaw Baanah ccapaw Heled, <verse number="31" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae kya-e Gibeah khuapaw Ribai ccapaw Ithai, Pirathon ccungccaw Benaiah, <verse number="32" style="v" />Gaash accya hae ccungccaw Hurai, Arbath ccungccaw Abiel, <verse number="33" style="v" />Baharum ccungccaw Azmaveth, Shaalbon ccungccaw Eliahba, <verse number="34" style="v" />Gizon ccungccaw Hashem, Harar ccungccaw Shagee ccapaw Jonathan, <verse number="35" style="v" />Harar ccungccaw Sakhar ccapaw Ahiam, Ur ccapaw Elifal, <verse number="36" style="v" />Mekherath ccungccaw Hefer, Pelon ccungccaw Ahijah, <verse number="37" style="v" />Karmel ccungccaw Hezro, Ezbai ccapaw Naarai, <verse number="38" style="v" />Nathan neitawpaw Joel, Hagri ccapaw Mibhar, <verse number="39" style="v" />Ammon ccungccaw Zelek, Beeroth khuapaw Naharai, aning tuh Zeruiah ccapaw Joab kya-e rhawtuk-zunghe ccyngtu nynh thua, <verse number="40" style="v" />Ithra ccungccaw Ira, Ithra ccungccaw Gareb, <verse number="41" style="v" />Hit ccungccaw Uriah, Ahlai ccapaw Zabad, <verse number="42" style="v" />Reuben phinpaw Shiza ccapaw Adina, aning tuh Reuben phin hae te amaw kya um hae paw sung thum hae cciakhaetu nynh thua, <verse number="43" style="v" />Maakah ccapaw Hanan te Mithni ccungccaw Joshafat, <verse number="44" style="v" />Ashterath ccungccaw Uzzia, Aroer ccungccaw Hotham ccapaw hae Shama te Jeiel, <verse number="45" style="v" />Tiz ccungccaw Shimri ccapaw Jediael te a neitawpaw Joha, <verse number="46" style="v" />Mahav ccungccaw Eliel, Elnaam ccapaw hae Jeribai te Joshaviah, Moab ccungccaw Ithmah, <verse number="47" style="v" />Mezoba ccungccaw Eliel, Obed te Jaasiel nynh thua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ramkaw kya David Zuitu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kish ccapaw Saul keiccuze David tuh rythyte a ccia bungthung kho khyh lyakhe, akawlan e ccungccaw hae tuh Ziklag khua umpaw David kalan oun thua hae paw nynh thua; minmin tuh rhawtuknaw kya David a bawmtu hae athungpaw rhawkaw hae kya a umbua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Minmin tuh thekawthya hae paw, mih voi mih rang te the kaw te lung deih athya hae paw, Benjamin phin hae, Saul a puizia hae nynh thua. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ale huapaw lupi tuh Ahiezer, tukoute Joash thua zah, parouh mawte Gibeah khuapaw Shemaah ccapaw hae nynh thua; Azmaveth ccapaw hae Jeziel te Pelet; Berakah, Anathoth ccungccaw Jehu, <verse number="4" style="v" />Gibeon khuapaw Ishmaiah, aning tuh Sung Thum hae kyaze athungpaw thua zah Sung Thum hae a uktu cciakhaetu nynh thua; Gederah khuaccaaw hae tuh Jeremiah, Jahaziel, Johanan, Jozabad, <verse number="5" style="v" />Haruf khuaccaaw hae tuh Eluzai, Jerimoth, Bealiah, Shemariah, Shefatiah, <verse number="6" style="v" />Korath ciihan hae tuh Elkanah, Isshiah, Azrel, Joezer te Jashobeam; <verse number="7" style="v" />te Gedor khuaccaaw hae tuh Jeroham ccapaw hae Joelah te Zebadiah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ramkaw rhawlungrua akoihkunaw a umpaw David kalan a cceih hae paw, thung zah rhawtuk boi vae hae paw, khawriaphua te ccoi a mangthya hae paw, mih maesue tuh chindeih maesue lo zah mua vaw e sazuh hawte mih liazawpaw Gad phin hae tuh: <verse number="9" style="v" />Lupi tuh Ezer, lu ningnaw Obadiah, lu thumnaw Eliab, <verse number="10" style="v" />lu palinaw Mishmannah, lu pangawnaw Jeremiah, <verse number="11" style="v" />lu taruhnaw Attai, lu sarinaw Eliel, <verse number="12" style="v" />lu taryanaw Johanan, lu takuanaw Elzabad, <verse number="13" style="v" />lu hawnaw Jeremiah, lu haw lae kheitnaw Makbannai. <verse number="14" style="v" />E Gad phin hae tuh rhawkaw hae kyaze bawi hae thua zah, adih huapaw tuh milu za kheit, ale huapaw tuh milu thong kheit a uktu hae nynh thua. <verse number="15" style="v" />E hae tuh masaty sawpaw kya Jordan vaw varae balyn tui pong aleiku lyaze vaw kha zua hae zah nithua lang te niccaw lang accya kya um hae paw kha a deetu hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Benjamin phin hae te Judah phin hae abang tuh David kalan rhawlungrua akoihkunaw lang oun thua hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />David nynh tungku khylan pounua hae zah, “Ccawkunaw te kae hynh bawm khylan nae cceih oh paw athua ze, ka nawccah; thuasalama ka tungvaw cyiseinaw a um lei pite, ka rhaw hae kuih kalan pya khylan nae cceih oh paw athua zetuh, ah minpaaw hae Pachia nynh muih sah lah, byapia vae sah,” a cipya hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tetuh sung thum hae lakuze lupi athuapaw Amasai tungvaw kya muisaw yn thua zah aning nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">“Pou David, kaening tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">na ccungccaw hae nynh kae thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">Pou Jesse ccapaw, namaw kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a pan hae paw nynh kae thua!</para>
  <para style="q1">Daenaw, daenaw tuh na kya um vae sah,</para>
  <para style="q2">daenaw tuh nang</para>
  <para style="q1">ae bawmtu hae kya um vae sah!</para>
  <para style="q2">Pawccecize na Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">nang ae bawmtu nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">Tetuh David nynh minmin kha lehkhan hae zah, a rhawkaw hae a uktu bawi lang a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David tuh Filistin hae ryte Saul dou khylan a ccia lya hae khe, Manasseh phin hae abang tuh David kalan a ccue hae. (David nynh Filistin hae kha bawm khyh hae, pawccecize Filistin uktu hae nynh tuanaw suelua hae zah, “Aening hynh oun phee cih zah a bawipaw Saul kalan oun zuakuh sei cih,” cite tua hae zah Ziklag lang a kisah hae.) <verse number="20" style="v" />David nynh Ziklag lang a ccia lyaze amaw kalan a ccue hae paw Manasseh phin hae tuh: Adnah, Jozabad, Jediael, Mikhael, Jozabad, Elihu te Zillethai; e hae tuh Manasseh phin kya-e milu athong a uktu lupi hae nynh thua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw thiingtu hae aphu kha dounaw kya minmin nynh David kha a bawm hae, pawccecize minmin tuh mih balynte athungpaw thua hae zah rhawkaw hae kya-e rhawbawi hae nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Pachia rhawkaw phu hawte myarya lepaw rhawkaw phu lang a tang mawlaezung ccungccaw hae tuh nin takyh mawte David bawm khylan oun thua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Hebron kya David Rhawkaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte, Saul peenaw kha David kalan pya khylan David a umnaw Hebron khua lang oun thua hae paw, zunghe a hoipaw rhawkaw hae phu kya-e milu rianaw tuh hynhte nynh thua. <verse number="24" style="v" />Judah ccungccaw hae khawriaphua te ccoi ccyngkute zunghe a hoipaw rhawkaw hae tuh thong taruh za tarya acih hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Simeon phin hae kya-e athungpaw rhawkaw hae tuh thong sari za kheit. <verse number="26" style="v" />Levi phin hae kya-e thong pali za taruh. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aaron ciihan hae cciakhaetu Jehoiada te amaw kya um hae paw tuh thong thum za sari. <verse number="28" style="v" />Athungpaw ccangvaepaw Zadok te a puizia hae kya-e rhawbawi hae lu kuin lae ning. <verse number="29" style="v" />Benjamin phin, Saul a puizia hae thong thum, e phin kya-e alunghua tuh Saul ciihan hae kya lungzite a um hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Efraim phin hae, mih puizia hae kya aphu-e hae paw, athungpaw rhawkaw hae thong kuin za tarya. <verse number="31" style="v" />David kha siapharan lang khang khylan ccia lan min ccazing law athua hae paw Manasseh phin angankuh hae tuh thong haw lae tarya acih hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Issakhar phin kya-e ccyh nyhthya zah Israel nynh a cyi lanpaw a nyhthya hae paw lupi za ning te mih kuihkaw e mih puizia hae balyn. <verse number="33" style="v" />Zebulun phin kya-e mih lungzipaw, eenaw ccangkheit te David kha bawm khylan, rhawtuk lan rhawtuk-zunghe phe ccing lan a ccyngkuh hae paw rhawkaw thong sung pangaw, <verse number="34" style="v" />Naftali phin kya-e rhawbawi thong kheit te minmin ryte um hae paw khawriaphua te ccoi a ccyngkuh hae paw rhawkaw sung thum thong sari. <verse number="35" style="v" />Dan phin kya-e rhawtuknaw ccangpya athua vae hae paw thong kuin lae tarya za taruh. <verse number="36" style="v" />Asher phin kya-e alungzipaw rhawkaw hae, rhawtuk lan paccynkute um hae paw thong sung pali. <verse number="37" style="v" />Jordan vaw khuraw lang um hae paw Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin hae angankuh kya-e rhawtuknawpaw zunghe phe ccing lan a ccyngkuh hae paw cciing kheit thong kuin acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />E hae balyn, rhawtuknaw kalan ccia lan paccynkute um hae paw tuh David kha siapharan lang khang lan cite eenaw ccaccing te Hebron khua lang a cceih hae; tuhmaminte tuhlaepaw Israel hae balyn tuh David kha siapharan lang khang khylan mih lungnging. <verse number="39" style="v" />Minmin tuh David ryte nin thum umkheih hae zah a ae a neih hae, pawccecize mih puizia hae nynh a paccynpya hae. <verse number="40" style="v" />Te anaenaw um hae paw nynh mah, Issakhar ram, Zebulun ram te Naftali ram kyacia um hae paw nynh looh kha lann, kalauh, lann adihpaw phin te tangnuapaw hae khate oun phu hae—aepaw aphuinphuin, saw, thaeku sanlou aphepaw hae, misu thae ange hae, misutui, chitui, tangnuapaw hae te tuu hae kha oun phu hae, pawccecize Israel ram kya lungpawnaw a um.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Kiriath-jearim umpaw Thingkua Lawnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2Sa 6.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh ccungccaw athong uktu te aza uktu rhawbawi hae te cciakhaetu miakaw ryte tuanaw a suelua hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh Israel ccungccaw zapi hae balyn kha, “Nanning nynh ahoy cite na tua oh zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia rynaw athua zetuh, Israel ram pynpi kya um hae paw tuhlaepaw ah uno hae, sahiin rampaeenaw hae a hoipaw khua hae kya um hae paw ranpibawi hae te Levi hae kha aening kalan pyku bua lan ccungccaw sawte hyy oh sih. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te ah Pachia thingkua kha ahmaw kalan bua lah oh sih; pawccecize Saul she lyaze aening nynh ah la sawphah oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Ccungccaw zapi balyn nynh tuhcite cyi lan mih nawccah, pawccecize tuh-e tuh ccungccaw balyn nynh a ry hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh Pachia thingkua kha Kiriath-jearim kyate cciakhae khylan Izip ram e Shihor vaw kyate Lebo-hamath khua kyacia um hae paw Israel hae balyn kha a pum hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:1-2">1Sa 7.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Cherubim vawlan a haungpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te kopaw Pachia thingkua kha law khylan Israel hae balyn tuh Baalah khua lang a cceih hae, tuh-e khua tuh Judah kya-e Kiriath-jearim khua nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Exo 25.22</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v" />Pachia thingkua kha le thawpaw vawlan khangte Abinadab inn kyate a cciakhae hae, Uzza te Ahio nynh le kha a mawng hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />David te Israel hae balyn tuh hlaw te tintang te tyng te daw te lanchi te mungkae hae khate Pachia malang khe mih thawzung balyn te a law hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khidon huimin kya he a thua hae te, tangnuapaw hae nynh thingkua kha a thyngbia hae keiccuze Uzzah nynh thingkua kha kyng khylan a kuih a dyngnua. <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thinrianaw tuh Uzzah tungvaw maee lang arua; thingkua kha a kyng keiccuze detah zah tuin kya Pachia malang khe a chih. <verse number="11" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Uzzah tungvaw a thinria keiccuze David tuh a thinria; tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh atunin cia Perez-uzzah cite a ko hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin nin khe David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha rih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua hynh pawtemou ka kalan ka thuakhae ngan cih?” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh thingkua kha David khua lungkhu lang teekhae khyh; Git khuapaw Obed-edom inn langkhe a cciakhae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Pachia thingkua tuh Obed-edom inn kyakhe a innbyn hae ryte sawpaw sah thum a um; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Obed-edom innbyn te a hoipaw balyn kha hythua a pya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 26:4-5">1Sh 26.4-5</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem kya David A Um</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2Sa 5.11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tair siapharan Hiram nynh David hanlan inn sakpya khylan locceihtu hae kha sidar thing hae, pazan thya hae paw te lehccama hae ryte a saw hae. <verse number="2" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha Israel siapharan lang a khangpaw te a ccungccaw Israel hae hanlan a peenaw a hangthungpaw kha David nynh a ny.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh Jerusalem khua kya zu hae hoichih zah David tuh ccapaw hae te ccanung hae patae paaw lang a tang. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh Jerusalem khua kya a saah hae paw a ccaaw hae min tuh: Shammua, Shobab te Nathan; Solomon, <verse number="5" style="v" />Ibhar, Elishua te Elpelet; <verse number="6" style="v" />Nogah, Nefeg te Jafia; <verse number="7" style="v" />Elishama, Beeliada te Elifelet.</para>
  <para style="s1">Filistin hae kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2Sa 5.17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />David tuh Israel siapharan lang chitui a thuh vae hae cipaw kha Filistin hae nynh he a thae hae te, Filistin hae balyn nynh David kha ccung khylan a cceih hae; tuh-e konglang tuh David nynh thae zah minmin kha tuk khylan a ccianua hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Filistin hae nynh oun cceih hae zah Refaim accya um hae paw kha a thiing hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />David nynh Pachia kha khia zah, “Filistin hae kha tuk lan ka ccianua cih hae tou? Minmin kha ka kuih kalan nae pya cih hae tou?” a cipya. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha, “Ccianua hae; pawccecize Filistin hae kha na kuih kalan kae pya ccaccing cih,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David tuh Baal-perazim lang cceih zah, tuin kyakhe minmin kha a tae hae. David nynh, “Pachia nynh ka rhaw hae kha avuakuhpaw tuileih hawte ka kuih te a vuasaku vae hae,” a ci. Tukeiccuze tuh-e hmin tuh Baal-perazim cite a ko hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih zohtuh hae kha tuin kya a vuasya hae, te David nynh kawpya hae zah maee te a soi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Filistin hae tuh bua oun cceih hae zah, accya kya um hae paw kha a thiing hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />David nynh Pachia kha bua he a khia tuh Pachia nynh, “Na deehui lan khyh hae; koihlu hae lah, balsam thing hae te arawsekunaw kyakhate na naangbia cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Balsam thing dung hae kyakhe mih siho kha he na thae te, rhawtuk khylan na pou cih; pawccecize Filistin rhawkaw hae kha chia khylan Pachia tuh na malang a cceih lalo vae,” a cipya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pachia nynh kaw a pya thyhte David nynh cyih zah, Filistin rhawkaw hae kha Geba kyate Gezer kyacia po a chia hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />David a minthaannaw tuh ram miakaw kya zeihkuh zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minphuin hae balyn kha David raw a risah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem lang Thingkua Cciakhaenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh amaw elang David khua khe inn hae kha a sakku, te Pachia thingkua elang hmin ccangkheit paccyn zah bu bukheit a thadynsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh, “Levi phin hae laelan humhung nynh mah Pachia thingkua kha puih lan khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh minmin kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua puih lan te amaw rya zungzae lawpya lan a po vae hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:8">Deu 10.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua elang a paccynpyapaw hmin langkhe cciakhae khylan David nynh Israel hae balyn kha Jerusalem kya a pum hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh Aaron ciihan hae te Levi phin hae kha a pum hae: <verse number="5" style="v" />Kohath ciihan hae kya-e lupi Uriel te a puizia hae za kheit lu kuin; <verse number="6" style="v" />Merari ciihan hae kya-e lupi Asaiah te a puizia hae za ning lu kuin; <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershom ciihan hae kya-e lupi Joel te a puizia hae za kheit sung thum; <verse number="8" style="v" />Elizafan ciihan hae kya-e lupi Shemaiah te a puizia hae za ning; <verse number="9" style="v" />Hebron ciihan hae kya-e lupi Eliel te a puizia hae sung tarya; <verse number="10" style="v" />Uzziel ciihan hae kya-e lupi Amminadab te a puizia hae za kheit lu haw lae ning.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />David nynh ranpibawi Zadok, Abiathar te Levi phin hae Uriel, Asaiah, Joel, Shemaiah, Eliel te Amminadab kha a ko hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh minmin kha, “Nanning tuh Levi phin lungkhu e puizia hae kya-e lu hae nynh na thua oh; nanning nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia thingkua kha ka paccynnaw hmin lang na cciakhae ccaw oh, naemaw te nae puizia hae kha thyaasakuh oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Masaty lyaze nanning nynh na puih khyh oh keiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ah Pachia tuh aening tungvaw a thinria; pawccecize aening nynh thingkua kha do-oih lan accan thyhte ah do-oih khyh oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia thingkua kha cciakhae khylan ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh a thyaasaku hae. <verse number="15" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya thyhte Moses nynh kaw a pya hae hawte, Levi phin hae nynh Pachia thingkua kha puihnawpaw ccong khate mih raw te a puih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:14">Exo 25.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />David nynh Levi phin kya-e lupi hae kha, nanning nynh lungpawnaw roi thawte saw khylan khuakupaw uccaw hae tintang, tintang dihpaw te lanchi hae a khua cih hae paw nae uno hae kha hlawsahtu lang na khang cih oh, cite kaw a pya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Levi phin hae nynh Joel ccapaw Heman, a unopaw Berekhiah ccapaw Asaf te mih uno Merari ciihan hae kya-e Kushaiah ccapaw Ethan; <verse number="18" style="v" />tuh-e hae ryte mih unopaw ccangningnaw bawi athua hae paw Zekhariah, Jaaziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah, Mattithiah, Elifelehu te Mikneiah, te thuakaw ngawtu hae Obed-edom te Jeiel. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hlawsahtu hae Herman, Asaf te Ethan tuh sohin lanchi kha a khua cih hae; <verse number="20" style="v" />Zekhariah, Aziel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Unni, Eliab, Maaseiah te Benaiah tuh Alamoth roi thyhte tintang a khua cih hae; <verse number="21" style="v" />thuasalama Mattithiah, Elifelehu, Mikneiah, Obed-edom, Jeiel te Azaziah tuh Sheminith roi thyhte tintang dihpaw te hlawsakhaetu athua cih hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Levi phin hae kya-e hlaw cciakhaetu Khenaniah tuh hlaw a thya keiccuze hlaw cciakhaetu athua cih. <verse number="23" style="v" />Berekhiah te Elkanah tuh thingkua elang thuakaw ngawtu hae athua cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Ranpibawi hae Shebaniah, Joshafat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zekhariah, Benaiah te Eliezer nynh Pachia thingkua malang khe mungkae a tu cih hae. Obed-edom te Jehiah mah thingkua elang thuakaw ngawtu hae athua cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David te Israel piccan hae, ccungccaw athong uktu hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha Obed-edom inn kyate lungpawte law khylan a cceih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua a puihtu hae Levi phin hae kha Pachia nynh a bawm hae keiccuze minmin nynh tangnuapaw sa sari te tuutepaw sa sari khate silawnaw a rae hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />David tuh nebaleihpaw laaw te kuakupaw angkiccua kha a kiku, thingkua a puihtu Levi phin hae balyn, hlawsahtu hae te hlawsahtu hae kya-e hlaw cciakhaetu Khenaniah mah tuhcite a kikuh bua hae; te David tuh laaw te kuakuhpaw ranpibawi angki kha a kikuh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuhcite Israel hae balyn nynh sia biate, saki, mungkae, lanchi, tintang te tintang dihpaw kha khuakute myarya ccae lan hlawsah biate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua kha a cciakhae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua tuh David khua he a tee lyakhe Saul ccanung Mikhal nynh thanlan-aw kyate do zah, David Siapharan nynh thohkute a lawpaw kha muih zah a thinlung kyate a theihrya.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Bu kya Thingkua A Nung hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pachia thingkua kha cciakhae hae zah David nynh a sakpyapaw bu lungkhu khe a nung hae; te Pachia malang khe maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha he a rae koute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te ccungccaw hae kha hythua a pya hae; <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel ccungccaw miakaw—nopi te pise phe lokuh lante—sanlou phe kheit, saw nge kheit te misu thae aroupaw aphe phe kheit cci kha ccarou a nee hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Levi phin hae abang kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thingkua malang ryalahtu lang, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia kalan sawsang khylan, lungtuabya ho khylan te thehoysah khylan a khang hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Lupi tuh Asaf, amaw koute lu ningnaw Zekhariah, Jeiel, Shemiramoth, Jehiel, Mattithiah, Eliab, Benaiah, Obed-edom te Jeie; minmin tuh tintang te tintang dihpaw a khua cih hae paw nynh thua; Asaf tuh lanchi a khua cih paw thua zah, <verse number="6" style="v" />ranpibawi Benaiah te Jahaziel tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang mungkae tyty a tu cih hae paw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Thehoysahnaw Hlaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Sam 105.1-15</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96.1-13</ref>, 106.1, 47-48)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Te tuin nin khe David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan thehoysahnaw hlawsah khylan Asaf te a puizia hae kha a khang hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan lungtuabya</para>
  <para style="q2">ho oh, a min kha ko oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a cyipaw kha ccungccaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">nysah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amaw kalan hlawsah oh,</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysahnaw hlawsah oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaeangthua lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalaw balyn kha ho oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A min thyaapaw kha phu-esah oh;</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a ccung hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">thinlung tuh a lungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te a thawzung kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungtua; a mitmae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ccung zungzae oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" />Pou a ryalahtu Abraham ciihan,</para>
  <para style="q2">a popaw Jakob ccaaw hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaeang lan umpaw a la cyipaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeang lan umpaw a ryalaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">a hopaw byapianaw kha liathui oh.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char></para>
  <para style="q2">ah Pachia nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">a byapianaw tuh laephi pynpi</para>
  <para style="q2">hanlan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A byakinnaw kha zungzae a liathui,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaw a pyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">she thong kheit cia a liathui,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abraham kya a raepaw byakinnaw,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Gen 12.7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:3">26.3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Isak kya a kinpyakupaw a byakinnaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakob kya phungbya lante</para>
  <para style="q2">tynsah zah,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17-18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:13">Gen 28.13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Israel kya zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">byakinnaw lante a tynsah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kanaan ram hynh rho lang</para>
  <para style="q2">kae pya cih,”</para>
  <para style="q1">a la cipaw kha a liathui.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Minmin tuh milu beihtaraw</para>
  <para style="q2">kyalya cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ramccang ccungccaw lang tangte</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />ram kheit kyate ram kheit kalan,</para>
  <para style="q2">pee kheit kyate ccangpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">pee kheit kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">he a khiavuikuh hae tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />minmin tungvaw tuaasahnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">rae lan, aning nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">humhung sanmah ua khyh;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.21-22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 20:3-7">Gen 20.3-7</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">minmin keiccuze siapharan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">pe hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Chitui ka thuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ty nan oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">ka profeh hae kha vawsawnaw</para>
  <para style="q2">pya nan oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Laephi ccungccaw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hlawsah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">a khumnaw thehoypaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nin takyhte ho oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Minphuin hae kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">a phu-enaw kha siakhae oh lah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw balyn kalan</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeangthua lan umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">a ryalaw kha ho oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh lesae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">thawmawte thehoysah lanpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q2">ccangpaw pachia hae balyn laeze</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtuahua lanpaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Minphuin ccangpaw hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">pachia hae tuh zohtuh hae nynh thua,</para>
  <para style="q1">thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlui kha a rae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sawtuanaw te lesaenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw malang a um;</para>
  <para style="q1">thawzung te lungpawnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw a umnaw hmin kya a um.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pou minphuin hae balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha thehoysah oh,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> a phu-enaw te</para>
  <para style="q2">a thungnaw kha thehoysah oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A phu-epaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thehoysah oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">silawnawpaw kha ccyngkute</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw malang cceih oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Alesaepaw thyaanaw khate</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha beik oh;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />laephi ccungccaw balyn,</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw malang rawrite um oh.</para>
  <para style="q1">Laephi tuh tynkaring lan a thadyn;</para>
  <para style="q2">nuekuh boi lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Vaawlui hae tuh mih lungpaw sah lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi tuh a lungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="q2">“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh siapharan nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">thua!” cite minphuin hae kya</para>
  <para style="q2">ho hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Rili te a lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">um hae paw tuh sia hae sah;</para>
  <para style="q1">loo te a lungkhu umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">atyn-are balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">mih lungtua sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Te ramkaw e thingku balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang lungtuate</para>
  <para style="q1">hlaw a sah cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kha byapia khylan yn thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh hoy zah</para>
  <para style="q2">atynpaw a sungsahnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae atyn keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kalan lungtuabya ho oh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:13">2Sh 5.13</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 7:3">7.3</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:11">Ezr 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 100:5">Sam 100.5</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:1">106.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 107:1">107.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 118:1">118.1</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 136:1">136.1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 33:11">Jer 33.11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Pou kaening oun khumtu Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q1">athyaapaw na min kha kae luung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">namaw thehoysahnaw kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q1">phu kae esah nawlan,</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae laku kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening hynh khumte</para>
  <para style="q2">oun suelua lah, oun luesah tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />
    <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae te zungzae cia thehoysah</para>
  <para style="q1">thua vae sah,”</para>
  <para style="m">cite ho oh. Ccungccaw balyn nynh, “Amen!” ci hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha the a hoysah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Jerusalem te Gibeon kya Beiknaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />David nynh Asaf te a uno hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua malang khe nin takyhte ahoboupaw rya kha tyty law khylan a nungsya hae, <verse number="38" style="v" />Obed-edom te a puizia hae sung taruh lu tarya kha mah a khang hae; Jeduthun ccapaw Obed-edom te Hosah tuh thuakaw ngawtu nynh athua hae. <verse number="39" style="v" />Te ranpibawi Zadok te a uno hae ranpibawi hae kha Gibeon khua ahangpaw hmin kya umpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikbu malang khe a nungsya hae, <verse number="40" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae kaw a pya hae paw a kawbya kya azeikuhpaw balyn thyhte, minmin nynh awkhua te zete ccyh kya maee-ute silawnawpaw silawhang vawlan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw kha tyty a rae cih hae. <verse number="41" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> sungsahnaw tuh zungzae atyn keiccuze amaw kalan lungtuanaw byaho khylan Heman te Jeduthun thuasah, popaw te min ccazing law athua hae paw mingccang hae thuasah minmin kya a umbua hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Heman te Jeduthun nynh hlawsahnaw hanlan mungkae te lanchi hae kha hoi hae zah hlaw thyaapaw hanlan khuakupaw uccaw hae kha a hoi hae. Jeduthun ccapaw hae kha thuakaw ngawtu lang a nung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Te ccungccaw balyn tuh mih inn raveih lang ki hae zah David tuh a innbyn hae kha hythuapya khylan a inn lang a cceih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.43: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:19-20">2Sa 6.19-20</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David tungvaw Pachia Byakinnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2Sa 7.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh a inn kya a um lyakhe David nynh profeh Nathan kha, “Dotua, kae tuh sidar thing inn kya ka um, thuasalama Pachia thingkua tuh boeibu kya nynh a um,” a cipya. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nathan nynh David kha, “Na thinlung kya a umpaw balyn kha cyih ccaleih, pawccecize Pachia tuh na kya a um,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama tuin khuazi khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh Nathan kalan yn thua zah: <verse number="4" style="v" />La cceih lah, ka ryalahtu David kha la hopah: <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Ka um nawlan inn yn sakpah nan. <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawccecize Israel hae kha ka poukhae hae nin kyate atunin cia inn lungkhu ka um khyh, thuasalama boeibu te beikbu lungkhu nynh ka um. <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel hae balyn ryte kae khiakunaw takyh kya ka ccungccaw hae kha do-oih khylan kaw ka pyapaw Israel byapiatu lukhakheit kha, “Pawccemou sidar thing inn nae sakpya khyh?” cite ka hopah boi tou? <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ryalahtu David kha hynhte na hopah cih: Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Nang tuh ka ccungccaw Israel hae kya uktu lang tang khylan tuurinnaw hmin kyate, tuu hae na zuinaw kyakhate kae ko; <verse number="8" style="v" />na ccianaw takyh kya na kya ka um zah, na rhaw hae balyn kha na malang te ka vua hae; laephi vawlan e alesaepaw ccungccaw hae min hawte alesaepaw min kha kae raepah cih. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka ccungccaw Israel hae elang hmin ccangkheit ka raepah cih hae zah, mimaw hmin kya a um nawlan hae te kaccohkale nung athua khyh nawlan hae ka tynsah cih hae; <verse number="10" style="v" />langmawlya ka ccungccaw Israel hae kya byapiatu hae ka nungpya lya hae hawte ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh vawsawnaw pya vae lan khyh hae; na rhaw hae balyn kyate nang kha haeungnaw kae pya cih.</para>
  <para style="p">Tuhpiaze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha inn innkheit ae sakpah cih cite nang kha kae thaesah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Na ccyh zaw vae zah, na minpaaw hae ryte he na ihkheih oh te, na pyn kyate a pou cih paw na ciihan tuh namaw koute ka hangthung cih zah a peenaw kha ka tynsah cih. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh ka min hanlan inn a sak cih zah a peenaw kha ka tynsah cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kae tuh a paaw ka thua cih zah aning tuh ka ccapaw athua cih. Nang na mawze a la umpaw ccungccapaw kyate atynpaw ka sungsahnaw kha ka law hawte amaw kyate ka lah lan khyh,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 6:18">2Ko 6.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:5">Heb 1.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />aning kha ka inn te ka peenaw kya zungzae ka tynsah cih zah, a bawitungkhung tuh zungzae atyn cih, a ci cite a hopya. <verse number="15" style="v" />E bya hae balyn te hynh-e vizin hae balyn thyhte Nathan nynh David kha a hopya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Sawsangnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2Sa 7.18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tetuh David siapharan nynh alungkhu lang tee zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang haung zah, “Pou Bawipaw PACHIA, kae tuh ahum ka thua zah, ka innbyn tuh pawcihawpaw innbyn athua keiccu mou hynhcih ciate nae hangthung? <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuasalama pou Pachia, e hynh tuh nang na muihnaw kya uccaw dihpaw nynh thua; na ryalahtu ciihan kong hynh mah malang ccyh hynhsepi hanlan cia na hoty vae. Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, kae hynh alesaepaw lu kheit hawte nae tua vae! <verse number="18" style="v" />Na ryalahtupaw kae, David nynh sawtuanaw ccou khylan na kalan pawmou ka ho kho ung cih? Na ryalahtupaw hynh phe na ny! <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na ryalahtupaw hanlan te namaw na thinlung kya a um thyhte, e alesaepaw uccaw hae balyn hynh nysahte e alesaepaw rya balyn hynh na law vae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae nakaring te kae thaepaw balyn thyhte nang ae lopaw lu kheit san um khyh zah namaw laelan ccangpaw Pachia um khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Izip ram kyate na shawkhaw hae paw na ccungccaw hae malang te minphuin hae na dee hae zah alesaepaw te ngaeang lan umpaw uccaw hae kha namaw min hanlan raekute, a ccungccaw hae lang tang khylan te shawkhaw khylan Pachia nynh a ccianua hae paw na ccungccaw Israel hae te alokuhpaw minphuin phuin kheit san laephi vawlan a um tou? <verse number="22" style="v" />Na ccungccaw Israel hae kha na ccungccaw lang zungzae tang khylan namaw hanlan na rae hae; pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh mih Pachia lang na tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />“Atu pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na ryalahtupaw konglang te a innbyn konglang na ho vae paw bya tuh zungzae tyn sah lah, bya na kinku vae hawte beih cyitua. <verse number="24" style="v" />‘Vaaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia tuh Israel a Pachia nynh thua,’ cite na min tuh zungzae tynsah te hangthung athua cih; na ryalahtu David ciihan tuh namaw malang tynsah athua cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawccecize ka Pachia, nang nynh na ryalahtupaw hanlan ciihan na raepya lanpaw kha na phypya vae; tukeiccuze na ryalahtupaw nynh namaw malang sawsang kho athua cipaw ka ny vae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang tuh Pachia na thua zah, e uccaw hoypaw hynh na ryalahtu kya bya na kinpyaku vae; <verse number="27" style="v" />tukeiccuze atu tuh na ryalahtupaw ciihan hynh namaw malang zungzae atyn nawlan hythua beih pya rytua. Pawccecize pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, nang nynh hythua na pya vae zah zungzae hythuapya athua,” a ci.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">David Peenaw Tyn zah Ako</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2Sa 8.1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute David nynh Filistin hae kha tuk hae zah a tae hae; David nynh Filistin hae kuih kyate Gath khua te khua taraw hae kha a law.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Moab ram kha tae zah Moab hae tuh David kuihkaw um hae zah ngunto kha a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh Zufrates vaw kya a lungbing bing khylan a ccia lyakhe Hamath langsang a umpaw Zobah siapharan Hadadezer kha mah a chia. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh aning kyate marangle thong kheit, marang rhawkaw thong sari te ccu rhawkaw thong kuin kha a kyng hae. David nynh marangle a suepaw marang hae balyn kha mih ccukantho a seih hae, thuasalama marangle za kheit hanlan phe azaw lante a haang bang hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaskas khua e Siria hae nynh Zobah siapharan Hadadezer kha bawm khylan he oun cceih hae tuh, David nynh Siria hae kha thong kuin lae ning a chia hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />David nynh Damaskas khua e Siria hae kyakhe rhawviatu hae kha a nung hae; Siria hae tuh David kuihkaw um hae zah ngunto a pya hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a ccianaw takyh kya taenaw a pya. <verse number="7" style="v" />Hadadezer a ryalahtu hae nynh a ccyng hae paw sui khawriaphua hae kha David nynh lah zah Jerusalem lang a phu. <verse number="8" style="v" />Hadadezer kya-e khua hae Tibaath te Kun kyate sohin patae kha David nynh a law. Tuh-e tuhte Solomon nynh sohin tuikua, sohin tung te sohin angphe hae kha a rae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:40-47">1Si 7.40-47</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:11-18">2Sh 4.11-18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zobah siapharan Hadadezer a rhawkaw hae balyn kha David nynh a tae vae cipaw Hamath siapharan Tou nynh he a thae te, <verse number="10" style="v" />David nynh Hadadezer kha tuk zah a tae keiccuze byabeih khylan te lungtuakhae khylan David Siapharan kalan khe a ccapaw Joram kha a saw; pawccecize Hadadezer nynh Tou kha atu te atu rhaw a tuk. Joram nynh ngun, sui, sohin te raekuhpaw uccaw hae kha a ccyngpya; <verse number="11" style="v" />tuh-e uccaw hae kha mah David Siapharan nynh a taepaw minphuin hae balyn, Edom hae, Moab hae, Ammon hae, Filistin hae te Amalek kyate a lawpaw sui te ngun hae ryte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan pynkheihlan a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw Abishai nynh Loi Accya kyakhe Edom ccungccaw hae thong haw lae tarya kha a chia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 60">Sam 60</ref> (Title)</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Edom ram kya rhawviatu hae kha a nung hae; Edom hae balyn tuh David kuihkaw a um hae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David kha a ccianaw takyh kya taenaw a pya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Kuihkaw e Bawi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuhcite David nynh Israel ram pynpi kha a uk; David nynh a ccungccaw hae balyn kha byading te ngingnaw te a uk hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw Joab tuh rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi thua zah Ahilud ccapaw Jehoshafat tuh ccazing zeitu nynh thua; <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahitub ccapaw Zadok te Abiathar ccapaw Ahimelek tuh ranpibawi hae thua hae zah, Seraiah tuh ryaccinkhan nynh thua; <verse number="17" style="v" />Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah nynh Khereth hae te Peleth hae kha a uk hae; David ccapaw hae tuh siapharan rya kya bawi lepaw hae nynh thua hae.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ammon hae te Siria hae kha Taenaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2Sa 10.1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tukoute Ammon hae siapharan Nahash tuh chih zah a ccapaw tuh amaw ccelang siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh, “Hanun paaw Nahash tuh ka tungvaw a lungzi keiccuze a ccapaw Hanun tungvaw kya lungzite ka ccuepe cih,” a ci. Tukeiccuze David nynh a paaw te asekuh lante lungtangnaw pya khylan locceihtu hae kha a saw hae. David a locceihtu hae tuh Ammon hae ram kya he a thua hae te, <verse number="3" style="v" />Ammon hae bawi hae nynh mih bawipaw Hanun kyakhe, “David nynh lungtangnaw pyatu hae kha na kalan yn saw hae keiccuze na paaw kha sawtuanaw a pyapaw nynh thua cite na tua tou? A ryalahtu hae tuh ram hynh akaw-aleih dote dophi khylan te ro khylan na kalan oun thua khyh hae tou?” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Hanun nynh David ryalahtu hae kha kyngte mih khawming kha a ngo hae, mih boeining kha ccepahthua te aw hae zah a cciasah hae, te minmin tuh a cceih hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh David kya he a hopah hae te, minmin tuh myaryamaw mih maethya keiccuze minmin kha cciadue khylan locceihtu hae a sawpya hae. Te siapharan nynh, “Nae khawming asae mawlaezung Jeriko khua kya la um oh, tukoute nae ki cih oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ammon hae nynh David tungvaw cceikhyanaw kae rae vae cipaw he a nyh hae te, Hanun te Ammon hae nynh Mesopotamia ram, Aram-maakah ram te Zobah ram kya-e marangle hae te marang rhawkaw hae hohnaw lanpaw ngun talent thong kheit kha a ky hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Marangle sung thum thong ning te Maakah siapharan te a rhawkaw hae kha a hoh hae, te cceih hae zah Medeba malang khe a rya hae. Mimaw khua raveih kya-e Ammon hae kha pum hae zah rhawtuknaw lang a cceih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh David nynh he a thae te, Joab te athungpaw rhawkaw hae balyn kha a saw hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Ammon hae tuh oun pou hae zah koikua teenaw kyakhe rhawtuk lan a um hae; oun cceih hae paw siapharan hae tuh mawmaw raveihte ramkaw khe a um hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Joab nynh nulang malang te rhaw yn tuk vae cih hae cipaw he a nyh tuh, Israel hae lungkhu e athung huaccepaw ccungccaw abang kha po hae zah Siria hae kha tuk khylan a nung hae; <verse number="11" style="v" />tuhlaepaw a ccungccaw hae kha tuh Ammon hae kha tuksah khylan a neitawpaw Abishai kuihkaw khe a nung hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Joab nynh, “Siria hae tuh ka hanlan myaryamaw a thung hae ze, nang nynh nae bawm cih; te Ammon hae tuh na hanlan myaryasankae a thung hae ze, kae ccianua cih zah kae bawm cih. <verse number="13" style="v" />Rawthungte um lah, ah ccungccaw hae hanlan te ah Pachia khua hae hanlan rawhoyte um sih; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ahoy a ci thyhte cyih vae sah,” a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tetuh Joab te a kya um hae paw tuh Siria hae kha tuk khylan naenuakuh hae zah, a malang te Siria hae tuh a ccue hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Siria hae a ccue vae hae cipaw kha Ammon hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, minmin mah Joab neitaw Abishai malang te ccue hae zah khua lungkhu lang a tee hae. Te Joab tuh Jerusalem lang a ki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama Israel hae nynh oun tae vae hae cipaw kha Siria hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, locceihtu hae saw hae zah Zufrates vaw khuraw lang um hae paw Siria hae, Hadadezer a rhawbawipaw Shofak nynh a uk hae paw kha a kosah hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh David kya he a hopah hae te, aning nynh Israel hae balyn kha pynkheihlan suelua hae zah Jordan vaw kha a zua hae, te rhaw hae kya thua hae zah minmin kha rawsete a rhawkaw hae kha umnaw a lawsahku hae. David nynh Siria hae kha tuk ty hae zah minmin nynh mah a tuk hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Siria hae tuh Israel hae malang te a ccue hae; David nynh Siria hae marangle ccikuh hae paw rhawkaw thong sari te ccu rhawkaw thong sung pali kha a chia hae, mih rhawbawipaw Shofak kha mah a chia. <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel hae nynh oun tae vae hae cipaw kha Hadadezer a ryalahtu hae nynh he a muih hae tuh, David ryte daenaw rae hae zah a kuihkaw kya a um hae. Tukeiccuze Siria hae nynh Ammon hae kha bawm ry vae khyh hae.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rabbah Khua Lawnaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2Sa 12.26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hawnin yn thua zah siapharan hae nynh rhawtuknaw lang ccia ccyh he yn thua tuh, Joab nynh rhawkaw hae kha cciakhae hae zah Ammon hae ram kha a ro hae, te cceih hae zah Rabbah khua kha a koihlu hae. Thuasalama David tuh Jerusalem khua kya a um. Joab nynh Rabbah khua kha tuk zah a tae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1">2Sa 11.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh mih siapharan kya-e bawilukhung kha a lu kyate poh a khyh; tuh-e lukhung tuh sui talent ccangkheit ri zah, a lungkhu khe aphutepaw lung a um; tuh-e tuh David lu kya a khungsah hae. Aning nynh khua lungkhu e luadepaw uccaw kha mah myarya lung lan a law. <verse number="3" style="v" />Khua lungkhu um hae paw ccungccaw hae kha poukhae hae zah thing-aw, sivaw muinzung te hae hae khate rya a lawsah hae. Tuhcite David nynh Ammon hae kya-e khua hae balyn tungvaw kya a cyi hae. Te David te ccungccaw hae balyn tuh Jerusalem lang a ki hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Filistin hae kha Rhawtuknaw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2Sa 21.15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hynh-e koute, Gezer kya Filistin hae ryte rhawtukkunaw a um; Hushath ccungccaw Sibbekai nynh ccungccaw lepaw hae mintaw lu kheit athuapaw Saf kha a chia; tetuh Filistin hae kha a tae vae hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Filistin hae ryte ccangpaw rhawtukkunaw bua a um; Jair ccapaw Elhanan nynh phaeccya cia acihpaw ccoi alua a kyngpaw Git ccungccaw Goliath neitaw Lahmi kha a chia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:4-7">1Sa 17.4-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />Te Gath kyakhe rhawtukkunaw bua a um, tuin kyakhe a pyn myarya lepaw ccungccapaw lu kheit, a kuihdung ccangtaruh cci, a ccudung ccangtaruh cci, abalynte ccangkuin lae pali asaepaw a um; aning mah ccungccaw lepaw hae ciihan nynh athuabua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh Israel hae kha he a theihrya hae tuh, David a upaw Shimei ccapaw Jonathan nynh amaw kha a chia. <verse number="8" style="v" />E hae tuh Gath khua kya um hae paw ccungccaw lepaw hae ciihan nynh athua hae; David te a ryalahtu hae kuih te a chih hae.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Milu Rianaw te Shethya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2Sa 24.1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Satan nynh Israel hae kha dou hae zah Israel ccungccaw hae kha milu ria lan David kha a tuhou. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh Joab te rhawkaw hae uktu rhawbawi hae kha, “La cceih oh lah, Beersheba kyate Dan kyacia Israel hae kha milu la ria oh, ccungccaw hohzeihmou a um hae cipaw ka ny ccaw nae thaesah cih oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Joab nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a ccungccaw hae kha aleit za kheit pungzaesah vae hae sah! Siapharan ka bawipaw, minmin tuh mih balyn mawte ka bawipaw a ryalahtu hae thua khyh hae tou? Pawccemou ka bawipaw nynh hynh-e hynh na cyi ry? Pawccemou Israel hae tungvaw kya cyiseinaw na thuakhae cih?” a cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama siapharan bya nynh Joab kha a tae. Tukeiccuze Joab tuh cceih zah Israel ram pynpi po lekuh lan cceih zah Jerusalem lang a ki. <verse number="5" style="v" />Joab nynh a riapaw ccungccaw milu ccazing abalyn kha David kalan a pya. Israel ram balyn kya thaloi a kyng khopaw cciing haw lae kheit a um hae, te Judah ram kya thaloi a kyng khopaw cciing pali thong sung sari a um hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama Levi phin hae te Benjamin phin hae kha tuh riabia khyh hae, pawccecize siapharan nynh kaw a pyapaw kha Joab nynh papin ry khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />E ryalaw hynh Pachia nynh ry khyh zah Israel kha de a tah. <verse number="8" style="v" />David nynh Pachia kha, “E rya ka lawpaw hynh myaryamaw ka sei vae. Atu namaw kalan saw ka sang, na ryalahtupaw ka cyiseinaw hynh beih yn vuapah; pawccecize myarya lepaw ngaeenaw rya kha ka lawsei vae,” a cipya. <verse number="9" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh David a profehpaw Gad kha hopah zah, <verse number="10" style="v" />“La cceih lah, David kyakhe, ‘<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho: Uccaw ccangthum kae pya, tuin kya-e ccangkheit kha pokuh lah, tuh-e tuh na tungvaw ka cyih cih,’ a ci cite la hopah,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gad nynh David kalan cceih zah, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hynhte a ho, ‘Na rypaw pokuh: <verse number="12" style="v" />kum thum lungkhu ccakanccinaw tou, tuhkhyhze sawpaw sah thum lungkhu na rhaw hae nynh nang kha deete thaloi te chiaku tou, tuhkhyhze nin thum lungkhu <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> thaloi keiccu ram lungkhu kya shethya thuate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Israel ram pynpi po lekuh lan ro tou, poku tua,’ a ci. Kae nynh yn sawtupaw kalan ka kikhae lanpaw bya kha atu riasakuh,” a cipya. <verse number="13" style="v" />Te David nynh Gad kha, “Myarya lepaw lungriathaenaw kya nynh ka um; <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuih lungkhu lang ka ccah sah, pawccecize a thawccinaw tuh myarya ale; thuasalama ccungccaw kuih lungkhu lang ka ccah nan sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel ram kya shethya a thuasah; Israel ram kya ccungccaw thong sung sari a chih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te Pachia nynh vaawpaw kha Jerusalem ro khylan a sawnua; thuasalama vaawpaw nynh vyavya a ro dyn khe, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh do zah tuh-e vawsawnawpi te asekuh lante ngaesikuh zah, rohtupaw vaawpaw kha, “Azaw vae! Na kuih kha khin ccavae,” a cipya. Te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw tuh Jebus ccungccaw Araunah kya-e huimin pe khe a thadyn. <verse number="16" style="v" />David nynh do zah vaaw te lae laku a thadynpaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw kha a muih, athuaakuhpaw thaloi kha a kuih kya ccyngkuh zah Jerusalem luki langkhe a hawisah. Tetuh David te piccan hae tuh buriboei lawkute a bakhung hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />David nynh Pachia kha, “Ccungccaw hae kha ria lan kaw a pyatu tuh kamaw ka thua khyh tou? A seitupaw te myarya ahoy lei lante rya a lahtu tuh kamaw nynh ka thua. E hae nynh pawmou a cyisei hae? Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia, na kuih nynh kamaw te ka paaw ciihan hae hynh oun rawse sah; thuasalama na ccungccaw hae tungvaw kya shethya beih thua nan sah, cite saw ka sang,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Silawhang te Silawnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />David nynh cceihthung sah lah, Jebus ccungccaw Ornan kya-e huimin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang kha rae sah cite David kha hopya khylan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw nynh Gad kha kaw a pya. <verse number="19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min te Gad nynh a hopyapaw bya thyhte David tuh a cceihthung. <verse number="20" style="v" />Ornan nynh chanvuih a tin cciamang lyakhe do zah vaawpaw kha a muih, amaw kya um hae paw a ccapaw hae lu pali tuh zya a rekuh hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />David nynh Ornan kalan a ccia lyakhe Ornan nynh do zah David kha he a muih tuh, huimin kyate cceih zah a mae kha laekhu kya bakhung zah David kha sawtuanaw a pya. <verse number="22" style="v" />David nynh Ornan kha, “Ccungccaw hae kya shethya hynh adae ccaw cite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan silawhang ka raepya nawlan na huimin a umnaw hmin hynh amee aphu thyhte yn pya,” a cipya. <verse number="23" style="v" />Ornan nynh David kha, “Lawkuh ccaleih; siapharan ka bawipaw nynh ahoy na ci hawte cyih ccaleih; dotua, maee-ute silawnaw lanpaw tangnuapaw hae, maeething lanpaw tuh looh tinnawpaw thing te ccathae silawnaw lanpaw chanvuih hae hynh kae pya. Abalyn mawte kae pya,” a cipya. <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuasalama David nynh Ornan kha, “Thua khyh; tuh-e hae tuh amee aphu thyhte kae re cih. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> hanlan na uccaw kha ka lawkuh lan khyh, amee pya leipaw maee-ute silawnaw kha mah ka rae lan khyh,” a cipya. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze David nynh Ornan kha tuh-e hmin mee lang sui shekel za taruh kha toupah zah a pya. <verse number="26" style="v" />David nynh tuin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang silawhang kha rae zah, maee-ute silawnaw te ccawkunaw silawnaw kha a rae. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha ko zah, maee-ute silawnawpaw silawhang vawlan khe vaawlang te yn ccahpaw maee khate Bawipaw nynh aphi a pya. <verse number="27" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh vaawpaw kha kawpya zah, a thaloi tuh a bu kalan bua a sang.</para>
  <para style="s1">Beikinn hanlan Hmin Ponaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe, Jebus ccungccaw Ornan kya-e huimin kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a leihrupaw kha David nynh he a muih tuh, tuin kyakhe silawnaw a rae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Moses nynh ramkaw kya a raepaw <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> beikbu te maee-ute silawnawpaw silawhang tuh tuh-e ccyh lyakhe Gibeon khua e ahangnaw hmin khe nynh a um; <verse number="30" style="v" />thuasalama David nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha byakhia khylan tuh-e silawhang malang khe cceih ngan khyh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> vaawpaw kya-e thaloi raw kha a rih.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Te David nynh, “Hein kya hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia inn athua cih zah hein kya hynh Israel hanlan maee-ute silawnawpaw silawhang athua cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Beikinn Sak lan A Paccyn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh Israel ram kya um hae paw ramccang hae kha sueluaku lan kawpya hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn saknaw hanlan lung-awtu hae kha lung aw lan a nung hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh thuakaw rae nawlan te thing piadenawpaw thingkhia lang sivaw patae kha pya hae zah sohin kha mah akhin toutae lei lan ciate a pya hae, <verse number="4" style="v" />sidar thing riatae lei kha a pya hae—pawccecize Sidon khuaccaaw hae te Tair khuaccaaw hae nynh David elang sidar thing patae kha a phupya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Te David nynh, “Ka ccapaw Solomon tuh a kum no ung zah a nynaw azya ung, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang sakpya lanpaw inn tuh myaryamaw asi-asah umpaw, a minthaanpaw te ram hae balyn kya a phu-epaw inn athua cih; tukeiccuze tuh-e inn hanlan ka paccyn vae cih,” a ci. Tukeiccuze David nynh a chi mawkhe uccaw patae a paccyn ty vae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Solomon te Cciakhaetu hae Byatawsyanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />David nynh a ccapaw Solomon kha ko zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia hanlan inn sakpya lan bya a tawsya. <verse number="7" style="v" />David nynh Solomon kha, “Ka ccapaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia min hanlan inn sakpya lan ka paccyn vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.7-10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2Sa 7.1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1Sh 17.1-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Thuasalama <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> bya tuh ka kya yn thua zah, ‘Nang tuh rhaw patae na tuk zah chiise patae na luasah vae; laephi vawlan ka muihnaw kya chiise patae na luasah keiccuze ka min hanlan inn na sak lan khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Dotua, ccapaw lu kheit na saah cih; aning tuh daenaw ccungccaw athua cih. A pepan e a rhaw hae balyn kyate daenaw ka pya cih; pawccecize a min tuh Solomon athua cih zah, a she lungkhu kya Israel hae kha daenaw te ccawkunaw ka pya cih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Aning nynh ka min elang inn a sak cih. Aning tuh ka ccapaw athua cih zah kae tuh a paaw ka thua cih, a siapharan bawitungkhung tuh Israel ram kya zungzae ka tynsah cih,’ a ci. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka ccapaw, nang te asekuh lante a ho vae hawte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia hanlan inn saknaw kya na laan na sui a ua nawlan <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na kya um vae sah. <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang kha Israel a do-oihtu lang rya he ae pya te, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> na Pachia phungbya kha na zui nawlan, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh hawnaw te nythyanaw kha ae pya vae sah. <verse number="13" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hanlan Moses kalan a pyapaw phungbya te phungzae hae kha hoyte na zui zetuh na laan na sui a ua cih. Na thawsae sah lah, na rawthung sah. Rih nan lah, na bungzou nan sah.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:6-9">Jos 1.6-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Vawsaw tacite <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn elang sui talent cciing kheit, ngun talent million ccangkheit, sohin te sivaw kha akhin toutae lei lan ciate ka paccyn vae, myarya lung lan a um vae; thing a-awkuhpaw te lung mah ka paccyn vae. E kyahin na paccyn chih cih. <verse number="15" style="v" />Ryalahtu patae na hoi: lung-awtu hae, pazan thya hae paw, lehccama hae te aphuinphuin kya kuihhae hoy hae paw riatae lei, <verse number="16" style="v" />sui, ngun, sohin te sivaw ryalawnaw kya athya hae paw kha na hoi vae hae. Atu ryalaw tho ccavae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> tuh na kya um vae sah,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />David nynh Israel cciakhaetu hae balyn kha mah a ccapaw Solomon rya bawm khylan kawpya hae zah, <verse number="18" style="v" />“<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia tuh nae kya um khyh tou? Aning nynh teitei langte balyn daenaw ae pya khyh oh tou? Pawccecize ram lungkhu um hae paw kha ka kuih kalan yn pya vae; ram tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te a ccungccaw hae kuihkaw nynh a um vae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Atu tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha nae tuanaw te nae thinlung balyn te ccung oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> min hanlan sakpaw inn lungkhu langkhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua te Pachia angphe athyaa hae paw kha teekhae khylan cceih oh lah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia beikinnthyaa kha sak oh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Levi Phin hae te Mih Ryalaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David tuh taw vae zah a she dianaw he thua te, a ccapaw Solomon kha Israel siapharan lang a khang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:1-40">1Si 1.1-40</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />David nynh Israel cciakhaetu hae balyn, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae kha a pum hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Levi phin hae, kum sung thum acih vae paw te palung lang kha ria hae zah mih balynte sung thum thong tarya acih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />David nynh, “E hae lungkhu e thong kuin lae pali nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya rya a lah cih hae, thong taruh tuh bawi hae te byapiatu hae athua cih hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />thong pali tuh sakoih ngawtu athua cih hae, thong pali nynh thehoysah nawlan ka raepaw khuakupaw uccaw hae khate <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha the a hoysah cih hae,” a ci. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te David nynh Levi phin hae kha Gershom, Kohath te Merari cite mawmaw phu raveihte a phia hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gershon ccapaw hae tuh Ladan te Shimei. <verse number="8" style="v" />Ladan ccapaw hae tuh: lupi Jehiel, Zetham te Joel, lu thum acih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Shimei ccapaw hae tuh: Shelomoth, Haziel te Haran, lu thum acih hae. E hae tuh Ladan ciihan hae kya-e lupi hae nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Shimei ccapaw hae tuh: Jahath, Zina, Jeush te Beriah. E lu pali hae hynh Shimei ccapaw hae nynh thua. <verse number="11" style="v" />Jahath tuh lupi thua zah Zizah tuh lu ningnaw nynh thua; thuasalama Jeush te Beriah tuh ccapaw patae saah khyh hae, tukeiccuze minmin kha puizia ccangkheit lante ccazing law athua hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kohath ccapaw hae tuh: Amram, Izhar, Hebron te Uzziel, lu pali acih hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Amram ccapaw hae tuh: Aaron te Moses. Aaron te a ccapaw hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe zungzaete mynkhuhpaw ute, amaw rya kha lawte, amaw min te hythua pyanaw kha zungzae a ho nawlan hae, athyaa huaccepaw uccaw hae kha thyaasah khylan taekhiate nung athua hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1">Exo 28.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia ccungccaw Moses a ccapaw hae kha tuh Levi phin kya a riabia hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Moses ccapaw hae tuh: Gershom te Eliezer. <verse number="16" style="v" />Gershom ccapaw hae kya Shebuel tuh lupi nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Eliezer ccapaw hae tuh: lupi Rehabiah; Eliezer tuh ccangpaw ccapaw hae saah khyh, thuasalama Rehabiah ccapaw hae tuh myarya alung hae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Izhar ccapaw hae kya Shelomith tuh lupi nynh thua. <verse number="19" style="v" />Hebron ccapaw hae tuh: lupihua Jeriah, lu ningnaw Amariah, lu thumnaw Jahaziel te lu palinaw Jekameam. <verse number="20" style="v" />Uzziel ccapaw hae tuh: lupihua Mikah te lu ningnaw Isshiah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Merari ccapaw hae tuh: Mahli te Mushi. Mahli ccapaw hae tuh: Eleazar te Kish. <verse number="22" style="v" />Eleazar tuh ccapaw saah khyh, ccanung hae kyalya saah zah a chih; mih puizia hae Kish ccapaw hae nynh minmin kha zu lang a dy hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Mushi ccapaw hae tuh: Mahli, Eder te Jeremoth, lu thum acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />E hae tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya ryalaw khylan min law athua hae paw, mih kum kumkuin te palung lang Levi phin hae, mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />David nynh, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh a ccungccaw hae kha daenaw a pya vae hae; te aning tuh Jerusalem kya zungzae a um. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tukeiccuze beikbu te a lungkhu kya ryalawnawpaw uccaw hae kha Levi phin hae nynh puih ho vae khyh,” a ci;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:8">Deu 10.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v" />pawccecize David nynh nyathyakou a hopaw bya thyhte, kum kuin lae acih vae hae paw Levi phin hae kha milu ccazing a law vae hae, <verse number="28" style="v" />“Thuasalama mih ryalaw tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e ryalaw kya Aaron ciihan hae kha a bawm cih hae, voidu hae te akhaan hae kha a do-oih cih hae, te athyaapaw uccaw miakaw kha a ccikan cih hae zah Pachia inn e ryalaw miakaw kha a lah cih hae;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.28-32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:5-9">Nam 3.5-9</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v" />nungpyapaw sanlou, ccathae silawnaw hanlan chanvuih khui, ransi phing leipaw sanlou phe, ruapaw sanlou silawnaw, chitui te pydepaw silawnaw, te alung azya toupaw rya te adih ale toupaw rya kha mah a bawm cih hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Zete takyhte awkhua takyh thadynte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha a luung cih hae zah the a hoysah cih hae, <verse number="31" style="v" />Sabbath nin, sawpaw thawpaw nin te khyapaw poi nin hae kya milu aho zeihte <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan maee-ute silawnaw rae athua takyh vae ze, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang tyty rya a lah cih hae. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuhcite minmin nynh tungkunaw bu te beikinnthyaa kha a do-oih cih hae zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn ryalawnaw kyakhe mih uno Aaron ciihan hae kha rya a bawm cih hae.”</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ranpibawi hae Rya Neenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aaron ciihan hae aphuphute phianaw tuh hynhte nynh thua. Aaron ccapaw hae tuh: Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar te Ithamar. <verse number="2" style="v" />Nadab te Abihu tuh mih paaw mawze chih ty hae zah ccapaw saah khyh hae; tukeiccuze Eleazar te Ithamar tuh ranpibawi lang a tang hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10.1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />David nynh Eleazar ciihan Zadok te Ithamar ciihan Ahimelek kha a pya hae paw mih ryalaw raveih thyhte rya a lawsah hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Eleazar ciihan hae tuh Ithamar ciihan hae laeze alunghua hae keiccuze Eleazar ciihan hae kya mih puizia raveih cciakhaetu lu hae lu haw lae taruh nung hae zah, Ithamar ciihan hae kya mih puizia raveih cciakhaetu lu hae lu tarya a nung hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin kha mih balynte phe lokuh lante, ccungthydungte ryalaw nee athua hae, pawccecize Eleazar ciihan hae te Ithamar ciihan hae lungkhu kyakhe beikinnthyaa piccan hae te Pachia ryalaw uktu piccan hae cite a um hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Levi phin Nethanel ccapaw ccawzeitu Shemaiah nynh siapharan, bawi hae, ranpibawi Zadok, Abiathar ccapaw Ahimelek, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae lungkhu e mih puizia raveih kya-e cciakhaetu lu hae malang khe min ccazing a law hae; Eleazar ciihan elang innbyn byn kheit kha po thua zah, Ithamar ciihan elang mah innbyn byn kheit kha po athua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ccungthydungte masaty accanpaw tuh Jehoiarib, ccangningnaw Jedaiah, <verse number="8" style="v" />ccangthumnaw Harim, ccangpalinaw Seorim, <verse number="9" style="v" />ccangpangawnaw Malkhijah, ccangtaruhnaw Mijamin, <verse number="10" style="v" />ccangsarinaw Hakkoz, ccangtaryanaw Abijah, <verse number="11" style="v" />ccangtakuanaw Jeshua, ccanghawnaw Shekaniah, <verse number="12" style="v" />ccanghaw lae kheitnaw Eliashib, ccanghaw lae ningnaw Jakim, <verse number="13" style="v" />ccanghaw lae thumnaw Huppah, ccanghaw lae palinaw Jeshebeab, <verse number="14" style="v" />ccanghaw lae pangawnaw Bilgah, ccanghaw lae taruhnaw Immer, <verse number="15" style="v" />ccanghaw lae sarinaw Hezir, ccanghaw lae taryanaw Happizzez, <verse number="16" style="v" />ccanghaw lae takuanaw Pethahiah, ccangkuinnaw Jehezkel, <verse number="17" style="v" />ccangkuin lae kheitnaw Jakhin, ccangkuin lae ningnaw Gamul, <verse number="18" style="v" />ccangkuin lae thumnaw Delaiah, ccangkuin lae palinaw Maaziah. <verse number="19" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Israel Pachia nynh kaw a pya thyhte, mih minpaaw Aaron nynh minmin elang rya a la nungpya hae hawte, e hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn lungkhu lang tee hae zah rya a law ccaw hae cite ryalaw nee athua hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Levi Phin hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw Levi ciihan hae tuh: Amram ccapaw hae kyaze Shubael; Shubael ccapaw hae kyaze Jehdeiah. <verse number="21" style="v" />Rehabiah ccapaw hae kyaze lupi tuh Isshiah. <verse number="22" style="v" />Izhar ccapaw hae kyaze Shelomoth; Shelomoth ccapaw hae kyaze Jahath. <verse number="23" style="v" />Hebron ccapaw hae tuh: lupi Jeriah, lu ningnaw Amariah, lu thumnaw Jahaziel, lu palinaw Jekameam. <verse number="24" style="v" />Uzziel ccapaw hae kyaze Mikah, Mikah ccapaw hae kyaze Shamir. <verse number="25" style="v" />Mikah neitaw Isshiah; Isshiah ccapaw hae kyaze Zekhariah. <verse number="26" style="v" />Merari ccapaw hae tuh: Mahli te Mushi. Jaaziah ccapaw hae kyaze Beno. <verse number="27" style="v" />Merari ccapaw hae tuh: Jaaziah kyate Beno, Shoham, Zakkur te Ibri. <verse number="28" style="v" />Mahli ccapaw tuh: ccapaw a saah leipaw Eleazar. <verse number="29" style="v" />Kish ccapaw tuh Jerahmeel. <verse number="30" style="v" />Mushi ccapaw hae tuh: Mahli, Eder te Jerimoth. E hae tuh mih puizia raveihte Levi phin hae nynh thua. <verse number="31" style="v" />E hae hynh mah David siapharan, Zadok, Ahimelek, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae mih puizia raveih kya-e lu hae malang khe Aaron ciihan mih uno hae nynh a cyi hae hawte, ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae lungkhu e mih puizia raveih kya-e cciakhaetu lu hae nynh ccungthy a dung hae.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn kya Hlawsahtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Asaf ccapaw hae, Heman ccapaw hae te Jeduthun ccapaw hae ryte tang-oi, tintang te lanchi hae kha khuakute beikpaw ryalawnaw hanlan David te rhawkaw hae kya-e bawi hae nynh ccungccaw hae kha taekhiate a nung hae. Tuh-e rya a lahtu hae te mih rya ccazing tuh hynhte nynh thua: <verse number="2" style="v" />Asaf ccapaw hae tuh: Zakkur, Josef, Nethaniah te Asrelah; minmin tuh siapharan nynh rya a naw hae thyhte Asaf kuihkaw kya umte profehbya a ho hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jeduthun ccapaw hae tuh: Gedaliah, Zeri, Jeshaiah, Shimei, Hashabiah te Mattithiah, lu taruh acih hae, mih paaw Jeduthun nynh cciakhaekute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan lungtuabya honaw te thehoysahnaw kya minmin nynh tang-oi khuakute profehbya a ho hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Heman ccapaw hae tuh: Bukkiah, Mattaniah, Uzziel, Shebuel, Jerimoth, Hananiah, Hanani, Eliathah, Giddalti, te Romamti-ezer, Joshbekashah, Mallothi, Hothir, Mahazioth nynh thua hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh Pachia nynh Heman kha kae hangthung cih cite bya a kinpyaku thyhte, siapharan kya-e muihdaetu Heman a ccapaw hae nynh thua; pawccecize Pachia nynh Heman kha ccapaw lu haw lae pali te ccanung lu thum a pya. <verse number="6" style="v" />Minmin tuh mih balynte mih paaw cciakhaenaw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya lanchi hae, tintang hae te tang-oi hae khuakute Pachia inn lungkhu hlawsahte rya a lah hae. Asaf, Jeduthun te Heman tuh siapharan kawpyanaw zakaw kya a um hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin te mih uno hae, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> elang hlawsahnaw ccangpya athua hae paw, a thya hae paw balyn tuh za ning sung tarya lu tarya acih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te minmin nynh adih te ale, sazae te siaimua phe lokuh lante mih ryalaw hanlan ccungthy a dung hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asaf ciihan elang ccungthydungte masaty accanpaw tuh Josef nynh thua; ccangningnaw tuh Gedaliah te a uno hae te a ccapaw hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="10" style="v" />ccangthumnaw tuh Zakkur te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="11" style="v" />ccangpalinaw tuh Izri te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="12" style="v" />ccangpangawnaw tuh Nethaniah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="13" style="v" />ccangtaruhnaw tuh Bukkiah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="14" style="v" />ccangsarinaw tuh Jesarelah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="15" style="v" />ccangtaryanaw tuh Jeshaiah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="16" style="v" />ccangtakuanaw tuh Mattaniah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="17" style="v" />ccanghawnaw tuh Shimei te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="18" style="v" />ccanghaw lae kheitnaw tuh Azarel te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="19" style="v" />ccanghaw lae ningnaw tuh Hashabiah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="20" style="v" />ccanghaw lae thumnaw tuh Shubael te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="21" style="v" />ccanghaw lae palinaw tuh Mattithiah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="22" style="v" />ccanghaw lae pangawnaw tuh Jeremoth te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="23" style="v" />ccanghaw lae taruhnaw tuh Hananiah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="24" style="v" />ccanghaw lae sarinaw tuh Joshbekashah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="25" style="v" />ccanghaw lae taryanaw tuh Hanani te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="26" style="v" />ccanghaw lae takuanaw tuh Mallothi te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="27" style="v" />ccangkuinnaw tuh Eliathah te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="28" style="v" />ccangkuin lae kheitnaw tuh Hothir te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="29" style="v" />ccangkuin lae ningnaw tuh Giddalti te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="30" style="v" />ccangkuin lae thumnaw tuh Mahazioth te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning; <verse number="31" style="v" />ccangkuin lae palinaw tuh Romamti-ezer te a ccapaw hae te a uno hae, lu haw lae ning.</para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sakoih Ngawtu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sakoih ngawtu hae rya neenaw tuh hynhte nynh thua: Korah phin Asaf ciihan hae kya-e Kore ccapaw Meshelemiah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Meshelemiah nynh ccapaw hae a saah: ccatawccaw tuh Zekhariah, lu ningnaw Jediael, lu thumnaw Zebadiah, lu palinaw Jathniel, <verse number="3" style="v" />lu pangawnaw Elam, lu taruhnaw Jehohanan te lu sarinaw Eliehoenai nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Obed-edom nynh ccapaw hae a saah: ccatawccaw tuh Shemaiah, lu ningnaw Jehozabad, lu thumnaw Joah, lu palinaw Sakhar, lu pangawnaw Nethanel,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.4-5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:11">2Sa 6.11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:14">1Sh 13.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />lu taruhnaw Ammiel, lu sarinaw Issakhar te lu taryanaw Peullethai nynh thua; pawccecize Pachia nynh Obed-edom kha hythua a pya. <verse number="6" style="v" />A ccapaw Shemaiah nynh mah mih puizia hae raveih kya uktu lang tang hae paw kha a saah hae, pawccecize minmin tuh myarya ryalah kho hae paw nynh thua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Shemaiah ccapaw hae tuh: Othni, Refael, Obed, Elzabad te ryalah kho hae paw mih uno hae Elihu te Semakhiah nynh thua hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh mih ccapaw hae te mih uno hae ryte Obed-edom ccapaw hae nynh thua, minmin tuh ryalawnaw hanlan athung hae paw, rya phe lah kho hae paw nynh thua; Obed-edom ciihan tuh sung taruh lu ning acih hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Meshelemiah nynh ccapaw hae te uno hae a hoi hae, rya phe lah kho hae paw pise lu haw lae tarya acih hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Merari ccapaw hae kya-e Hosiah nynh ccapaw hae a saah: lupi tuh Shimri (aning tuh ccatawccaw athua khyh zemah a paaw nynh lupi lang a nung), <verse number="11" style="v" />lu ningnaw Hilkiah, lu thumnaw Tebaliah, lu palinaw Zekhariah; Hosah ccapaw hae te a uno hae tuh mih balynte lu haw lae thum acih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mih uno hae nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya rya a hoi hae hawte, e sakoih ngawtu hae lang ryalaw nee athua hae paw hynh nynh mih piccan hae raveih thyhte rya a hoibua hae; <verse number="13" style="v" />mih sakoih hanlan milu alung azya ci um leite, phe lokuh lante mih puizia hae raveihte ccungthy a dung hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nithua lang e sakoih hanlan ccungthydungte a muepaw tuh Shelemiah nynh thua, a ccapaw Zekhariah, ahawpaw tuanaw pyatu hanlan ccungthydung hae zah thahlang sakoih hanlan a mue. <verse number="15" style="v" />Obed-edom tuh ccungthydung zah alia lang e sakoih hanlan mue zah a ccapaw hae tuh sisuainn do-oihtu lang a mue hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Shuppim te Hosah tuh niccaw lang e sakoih hanlan a mue hae, tuh-e tuh akaethungpaw laanpi kya umpaw Shallekheth sakoih kya nynh a um. Phe lokuh lante a ngaw hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Nin takyhte nithua langkhe lu taruh tyty a um hae, thahlang khe nin takyhte lu pali tyty um hae zah alia langkhe nin takyhte lu pali tyty a um hae, te sisuainn kya ccyh kheit ze, lu ning ccite a um hae; <verse number="18" style="v" />niccaw lang umpaw inn taraw elang kha laanpi kya lu pali te inn taraw kya lu ning a um hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />E hae tuh Korah ccaawno hae te Merari ccaawno hae kya-e sakoih ngawtu hae aphuphute ryalaw neenaw nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Beikinn Ryalaw hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi phin hae lungkhu e, Ahijah nynh Pachia inn kya-e sisua hae te pyapaw lasung hae kha a ngaw. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ladan ccapaw hae, Ladan te asekuhpaw Gershon ciihan hae kya-e ccapaw hae, Gershon ciihan athuapaw Ladan te asekuhpaw puizia hae kya-e lu tuh Jehieli.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jehieli ccapaw Zetham te a unopaw Joel tuh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn e sisua hae kha a do-oihtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Amram ciihan hae, Izhar ciihan hae, Hebron ciihan hae te Uzziel ciihan hae kha mah ryalaw neebua athua hae: <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses ccapaw Gershom a ccapaw Shebuel tuh sisua hae do-oihnaw kyaze ale huapaw bawi nynh thua. <verse number="25" style="v" />A uno hae tuh: Gershom a neitaw Eliezer, Eliezer ccapaw Rehabiah, Rehabiah ccapaw Jeshaiah, Jeshaiah ccapaw Joram, Joram ccapaw Zikhri, Zikhri ccapaw Shelomoth. <verse number="26" style="v" />Shelomoth te a uno hae tuh David siapharan, mih puizia hae raveih kya-e lu hae, ccungccaw athong uktu hae te ccungccaw aza uktu bawi hae te rhawkawphu kya-e rhawbawi hae nynh a hlu hae paw lasung hae, sisua hae balyn kha a do-oihtu hae nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Minmin nynh rhawtuknaw kya-e a luade hae paw uccaw hae kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn do-oihnaw hanlan a hlu hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Profeh Samuel, Kish ccapaw Saul, Ner ccapaw Abner te Zeruiah ccapaw Joab nynh a hlu hae paw uccaw miakaw—a pya hae paw lasung balyn kha Shelomoth te a neitaw hae nynh a do-oih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izhar ciihan hae lungkhu e, Khenaniah te a ccapaw hae tuh Israel hae hanlan atolang e ryalaw kya bawi hae te byapiatu hae lang nung athua hae. <verse number="30" style="v" />Hebron ciihan hae lungkhu e, Hashabiah te a uno hae, rya phe lah kho hae paw ccungccaw thong kheit za sari nynh Israel ram lungkhu Jordan niccaw lang kyakhe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> rya balyn te siapharan rya balyn kha a law hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Hebron ciihan hae lungkhu e Jerijah tuh Hebron ciihan hae lupi nynh thua. (David nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum sung palinaw kum khe tuh-e ciihan hae kha ccung hae zah Gilead ram Jazer khua khe minmin laku e myarya ryalah kho hae paw kha a muih hae.) <verse number="32" style="v" />Jerijah te a uno hae, rya phe lah kho hae paw, mih puizia hae raveih kya lu athua hae paw thong ning za sari kha Reuben phin hae, Gad phin hae te Manasseh phin angankuh kha a uktu lang David siapharan nynh nung hae zah, minmin nynh Pachia rya te siapharan rya aphuinphuin kha a law hae.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Rhawkaw hae Ryalaw Neenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />E tuh Israel hae, mih puizia raveih kya-e lu hae, ccungccaw athong uktu te aza uktu rhawbawi hae te mih bawi hae, a tee a pou hae paw aphupi hae te asekuhpaw rya miakaw kya kum kheit lungkhu sawpaw sah kheit koute sah kheit siapharan rya a lawpah hae paw ccazing nynh thua, aphu phu kheit cci kya milu thong kuin lae pali cci a um hae:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zabdiel ccapaw Jashobeam tuh sawpaw sah kheitnaw kya masaty aphu kha a uktu nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aning tuh Perez ciihan thua zah masaty sawpaw kya rhawbawi hae balyn a uktu lupi nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Sawpaw sah ningnaw e aphu a uktupaw tuh Aho ciihan athuapaw Dodai nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Sawpaw sah thumnaw hanlan lu thumnaw rhawbawi tuh ranpibawi Jehoiada ccapaw Benaiah thua zah lupi nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />E Benaiah hynh sung thum hae kyaze athungpaw ccungccaw thua zah, sung thum kha a uk hae; amaw phu kha a ccapaw Ammizabad nynh a uk. <verse number="7" style="v" />Sawpaw sah palinaw hanlan lu palinaw rhawbawi tuh Joab neitaw Asahel thua zah amaw koute a ccapaw Zebadiah nynh a uk hae; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Sawpaw sah pangawnaw hanlan lu pangawnaw rhawbawi tuh Izrah ciihan Shamhuth nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Sawpaw sah taruhnaw hanlan lu taruhnaw rhawbawi tuh Tekoa khuapaw Ikkesh ccapaw Ira nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Sawpaw sah sarinaw hanlan lu sarinaw rhawbawi tuh Efraim phin Pelon ciihan Helez nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Sawpaw sah taryanaw hanlan lu taryanaw rhawbawi tuh Hushath ciihan Sibbekai nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Sawpaw sah takuanaw hanlan lu takuanaw rhawbawi tuh Benjamin phin Anathoth ciihan Abiezer nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Sawpaw sah hawnaw hanlan lu hawnaw rhawbawi tuh Zerah ciihan Netofah ccungccaw Maharai nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Sawpaw sah haw lae kheitnaw hanlan lu haw lae kheitnaw rhawbawi tuh Efraim phin Pirathon ciihan Benaiah nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Sawpaw sah haw lae ningnaw hanlan lu haw lae ningnaw rhawbawi tuh Othniel ciihan Netofath ccungccaw Heldai nynh thua; a phu kya milu thong kuin lae pali a um hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Phin hae kya-e Cciakhaetu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Israel phin hae a uktu bawi hae tuh: Reuben phin hae hanlan Zikhri ccapaw Eliezer tuh lupihua bawi nynh thua; Simeon phin hae hanlan Maakah ccapaw Shefatiah; <verse number="17" style="v" />Levi phin hanlan Kemuel ccapaw Hashabiah; Aaron ciihan hanlan Zadok; <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah phin hanlan David a upaw Elihu; Issakhar phin hanlan Mikhael ccapaw Omri; <verse number="19" style="v" />Zebulun phin hanlan Obadiah ccapaw Ishmaiah; Naftali phin hanlan Azriel ccapaw Jerimoth; <verse number="20" style="v" />Efraim phin hanlan Azaziah ccapaw Hoshea; Manasseh phin angankuh hanlan Pedaiah ccapaw Joel; <verse number="21" style="v" />Gilead ram umpaw Manasseh phin angankuh hanlan Zekhariah ccapaw Iddo; Benjamin phin hanlan Abner ccapaw Jaasiel; <verse number="22" style="v" />Dan phin hanlan Jeroham ccapaw Azarel nynh thua. <verse number="23" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel kha vaawlui e awsi zeih alung lan kae pungzaesah cih cite bya a kinpyaku keiccuze David nynh kum kuin te akaw lang kha tuh ria khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Gen 15.5</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 22:17">22.17</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 26:4">26.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Zeruiah ccapaw Joab nynh milu riapaw rya kha a tho, thuasalama thangsah khyh; tuh-e cyiseinaw keiccuze Israel tungvaw kya thinrianaw ccah zah, tuh-e milu rianaw tuh David Siapharan Sherianaw Ccauh kya zeibia khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:1-15">2Sa 24.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 21:1-14">1Sh 21.1-14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Ccangpaw Bawi hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Siapharan sisua a do-oihtu tuh Adiel ccapaw Azmaveth nynh thua. Ram kya umpaw, khuapi hae kya umpaw, khua taraw hae kya umpaw te innhangpaw hae kya umpaw sisua hae kha a do-oihtu tuh Uzziah ccapaw Jonathan nynh thua. <verse number="26" style="v" />Laephi kya loopho te ryalah hae paw a do-oihtu tuh Khelub ccapaw Ezri nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Misu khokhu a do-oihtu tuh Ramah khuapaw Shimei nynh thua; misu khokhu kyate apoupaw misutui ccakhungnaw a do-oihtu tuh Shifmot khuapaw Zabdi nynh thua. <verse number="28" style="v" />Shefelah kya umpaw oliv ku te eboh ku hae a do-oihtu tuh Geder ccungccaw Baalhanan nynh thua. Chitui ccakhungnaw inn a do-oihtu tuh Joash nynh thua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Sharon kya rampaee hae paw sahiin phu a do-oihtu tuh Sharon ccungccaw Shitrai nynh thua; accya kya rampaee hae paw sahiin phu a do-oihtu tuh Adlai ccapaw Shafat nynh thua. <verse number="30" style="v" />Kalauh a do-oihtu tuh Ishmael ccungccaw Obil nynh thua; lann hae a do-oihtu tuh Meronoth ccungccaw Jehdeiah nynh thua. Tuuphu a do-oihtu tuh Hag ccungccaw Jaziz nynh thua. <verse number="31" style="v" />E hae balyn tuh David Siapharan nynh a hoirumpaw kha a do-oihtu hae nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />David a paaw neitawpaw Jonathan tuh tuanaw pyatu thua zah a hawpaw te ccawthyapaw nynh thua; Hakhmoni ccapaw Jehiel nynh siapharan ccapaw hae kha a do-oih hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahithofel tuh siapharan kha tuanaw a pyatu thua zah Arki khuapaw Hushai tuh siapharan banpaw nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahithofel koute Benaiah ccapaw Jehoiada te Abiathar tuh tuanaw pyatu lang a tang hae. Joab tuh siapharan rhawkaw hae a uktu rhawbawi nynh thua.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn A Sak cih paw Solomon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David nynh Israel bawi hae balyn, mih phin raveih kya-e bawi hae, siapharan rya a lahpaw aphu hae kya-e bawi hae, ccungccaw athong uktu rhawbawi hae, aza uktu rhawbawi hae, siapharan te a ccapaw hae uccaw te sahiin hae balyn a do-oihtu hae, siapharan inn bawi hae, athungpaw rhawkaw hae te mih rawthung hae paw balyn kha pynkheihlan a pum hae. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te David siapharan nynh thadyn zah: “Ka uno hae te ka ccungccaw hae, ngaetua oh. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua hanlan te ah Pachia ccu a synaw hanlan haeungnaw inn kha sak lan ka paccyn vae; tuh-e inn saknaw hanlan ka paccyn kou vae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.2-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2Sa 7.1-16</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 17:1-14">1Sh 17.1-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuasalama Pachia nynh kae kha, ‘Nang nynh ka min hanlan inn na sak lan khyh, pawccecize nang tuh rhawkaw na thua zah chiise na luasah,’ yn cipya. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, Israel Pachia nynh kae hynh ka paaw puizia hae balyn kyate Israel a uktu siapharan lang zungzae tang khylan yn po; pawccecize Judah kha cciakhaetu lang a po, te Judah innbyn hae kyaze ka paaw innbyn hae kha po zah ka paaw ciihan hae kyaze kae hynh a lungrythua zah Israel hae balyn a uktu siapharan lang yn rae. <verse number="5" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh ccapaw patae yn pya zah, ka ccapaw hae balyn kyaze ka ccapaw Solomon tuh Israel kha ukte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> peenaw bawitungkhung vawlan haung lan a po vae. <verse number="6" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh kae kha, ‘Ka inn te ka voidu a saktu tuh na ccapaw Solomon nynh athua cih, pawccecize amaw kha ka ccapaw lang ka po vae zah kae tuh a paaw ka thua cih. <verse number="7" style="v" />Aning nynh ka kawbya hae te ka phungzae hae kha atunin a zui hawte tynkaring lan po a zui zetuh a peenaw kha zungzae ka tynsah cih,’ a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nanning nynh e ram hoypaw hynh na ccou oh zah naemaw koute nae ccaaw hae elang rho lang zungzae na nungpya sya nawlan oh, Israel hae balyn, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ccungccaw zapi balyn muihnaw te ah Pachia a thaenaw kyahin, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kawbya balyn kha ccung oh lah zui oh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Te nang, ka ccapaw Solomon, na paaw Pachia kha nyh lah, tuanaw ccangkheit te thinlung ccaccing te amaw rya kha lawtua; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh tuh tuanaw miakaw kha akaw-aleih muih zah, paccynpaw te tuanaw miakaw kha phe a ny. Amaw kha na ccung zetuh na muih cih; thuasalama amaw kha na vua zetuh nang kha zungzae ae vua cih. <verse number="10" style="v" />Raeringkuh, pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh nang kha beikinnthyaa lanpaw inn kha sak lan ae po vae; na thawsaesakuh lah, ryalawtua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh David nynh a ccapaw Solomon kha beikinn tee takawnaw akhaan, a inn hae, sisuakhaan hae, palung khaan hae, alungkhu lang e akhaan hae te byakin thingkua ahu nungnaw lanpaw akhaan pungsan asoikuhpaw kha a pya; <verse number="12" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn voidu hae, po voilu lan umpaw akhaan hae, Pachia inn e sisuakhaan hae te pyapaw lasung hae nungnawpaw sisuakhaan hae, a thinlung kya a umpaw miakaw thyhte pungsan kha a pya; <verse number="13" style="v" />ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae nynh aphuphute a um nawlan hae te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya law lanpaw rya miakaw, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya ryalawnawpaw angphe miakaw hanlan te <verse number="14" style="v" />rya miakaw lawnaw lanpaw sui angphe hae balyn hanlan sui kha aho zeihte, rya miakaw lawnaw lanpaw ngun angphe hae hanlan ngun kha aho zeihte, <verse number="15" style="v" />sui maeekhuatung hae te maeeinn hae hanlan sui aho zeihte, maeekhuatung te a maeeinn raveih hae hanlan sui aho zeihte, a maeekhuatung te a maeeinn raveih hanlan ngun aho zeihte ryalawnaw raveih kya mang aho thyhte, <verse number="16" style="v" />nungpyapaw sanlou nungnawpaw sui ccaboi raveih hanlan sui aho zeihte, te ngun ccaboi elang ahopaw ngun kha aho zeihte tou zah a pya; <verse number="17" style="v" />phedung, pakepi te banang hanlan sui ccipaw kha thuasah, sui pakekhupaw hae te ngun pakekhupaw hae ccangkheit cci hanlan ahopaw sui te ngun kha thuasah tou zah a pya; <verse number="18" style="v" />mynkhuhpaw maee-unawpaw silawhang elang sui ccipaw kha tou zah a pya, te mih sake daw hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> byakin thingkua a bongpaw cherubim kya-e sui marangle hanlan amaw kya-e pungsan kha mah a pya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />David nynh, “E hae balyn hynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a hopaw kha zei athua thyhte, law lanpaw rya paccynnaw miakaw kha thaethyanawpaw hawnaw yn pya vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />David nynh a ccapaw Solomon kha, “Na thawsaesakuh lah, rawthungte ryalawtua. Rih nan, na bungzou nan sah; pawccecize <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia, ka Pachia tuh na kya a um. <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn kya ryalawnaw hanlan rya miakaw na lyn mawlaezung aning nynh nang kha ae vua lan khyh zah shungnaw ae pya lan khyh. <verse number="21" style="v" />Pachia inn e rya miakaw law khylan, hein kya ranpibawi hae te Levi phin hae tuh aphuphute a um hae; ryalaw miakaw kya ryalaw aphuinphuin a thya hae paw balyn tuh na kya a um hae; bawi hae te ccungccaw balyn mah na kuihkaw marya a um cih hae,” a cipya.</para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Beikinn Sak nawlan Ahlu hae</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />David siapharan nynh ccungccaw zapi hae kha, “Pachia nynh a popaw ka ccapaw Solomon tuh a kum no ung zah a nynaw azya ung, ryalaw tuh myaryamaw ale; pawccecize beikinn tuh ccungccaw hanlan thua khyh, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> Pachia hanlan nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.1-2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:5">1Sh 22.5</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka Pachia inn hanlan ka cyi kho thyhte ka cyi vae, sui uccaw hae rae nawlan sui, ngun uccaw hae rae nawlan ngun, sohin uccaw hae rae nawlan sohin, sivaw uccaw hae rae nawlan sivaw, thing uccaw hae rae nawlan thing, tuhpiaze ccaan nawlan oniks lung patae te lung patae, antimoni lung, azong aphuinphuin umpaw lung hae, aphutepaw lung aphuinphuin te marbal lung kha patae ka paccyn vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuhpiaze e hae balyn koute, inn thyaapaw hanlan ka paccyn, ka Pachia inn kha myarya aphu ka tesah keiccuze kamaw ka kya-e sui te ngun kha ka Pachia inn hanlan ka pya: <verse number="4" style="v" />inn kya-e pang hae thei nawlan sui talent thong thum, Ofir sui, ngun ccipaw talent thong sari, <verse number="5" style="v" />kuihhae hoy hae paw nynh a cyi lan hae paw rya miakaw elang sui uccaw hanlan sui, ngun uccaw hanlan ngun kha ka pya hae. Tukeiccuze atunin kya mawtemaw thyaasakute <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan hummou lungthote a hlu cih?” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Puizia raveih kya-e cciakhaetu hae nynh lungthote ahlu a pya hae, phin hae kya-e cciakhaetu hae, ccungccaw athong te aza uktu rhawbawi hae te siapharan rya uktu bawi hae nynh mah tuhcite a hlubua hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh Pachia inn elang ryalaw nawlan sui talent thong pangaw, darik<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">darik - Persia phua nynh thua.</char></note> thong haw, ngun talent thong haw, sohin talent thong haw lae tarya, sivaw talent cciing kheit a pya hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Aphutepaw lung a hoipaw miakaw nynh mih lung kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> inn sisuakhaan kalan, Gershon ciihan Jehiel nynh a do-oihpaw khaan lungkhu khe a pya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te ccungccaw hae tuh lunglokute mimaw lungthote <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan a pya hae keiccuze mih lungtua; David Siapharan mah myarya a lungtua.</para>
  <para style="s1">David nynh Pachia Thehoysahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tetuh David nynh ccungccaw zapi hae balyn malang khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kha the a hoysah; David nynh: “Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae minpaaw hae Pachia, nang tuh zungzae te zungzae cia ae thehoysah vae hae sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, lesaenaw, huhan, phu-enaw, taenaw te sawtuanaw tuh namaw kya-e nynh thua; pawccecize vaaw te lae kya a umpaw balyn tuh namaw kya-e nynh thua; pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, peenaw tuh namaw kya-e thua zah nang tuh atyn-are luki umpaw lu lang hangthung na thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:13">Mat 6.13</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Hoirumnaw te sawtuanaw tuh namaw kyate yn thua zah, nang nynh atyn-are na uk. Na kuih kya thungnaw te thawsaenaw a um; ccungccaw balyn kha lesaesahnaw kaw te thawzung pyanaw kaw tuh na kuih kya nynh a um. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae Pachia, nang kha kae luung zah asung-epaw na min kha kae thehoysah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Thuasalama kaening nynh lungthote hynhzeih kae hlu kho nawlan, kae te ka ccungccaw hae tuh hum hae mou kae thua? Pawccecize atyn-are tuh namaw kyate yn thua zah, na uccaw toulou kha namaw kae pya. <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaening tuh kae minpaaw hae balyn hawte, namaw malang khuaccong hae paw mikhia hae nynh kae thua; lae vawlan kae ccyh tuh mynlyh hawte thua zah ngaehoinaw um khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae Pachia, na min thyaapaw hanlan inn sakpya nawlan kaening nynh kae paccynpaw hynh-e uccaw balyn tuh na kuih kyate yn thuapaw thua zah namaw kya-e cci nynh thua. <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka Pachia, nang tuh thinlung kha na syntawtua zah dingnaw kyakhe na lungrythua; ka thinlung dingnaw khate hynh-e uccaw balyn hynh lungthote kae pya, atu hein kya umpaw na ccungccaw hae nynh lungthote lungpawte ae pya hae paw kha ka muih vae. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, kae minpaaw hae Abraham, Isak te Israel Pachia, hynhcihawpaw eenaw te tuanaw hynh na ccungccaw hae thinlung kya tyty nung lah, mih thinlung kha namaw kalan cciakhae hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ccapaw Solomon nynh na kawbya hae, na phunglang hae te na phungbya hae kha lungkheit te zuite marya cyih zah, ka paccyn vae paw beikinn hynh a sak kho nawlan amaw kha beih bawmtua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tukoute David nynh ccungccaw zapi balyn kha, “<char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nae Pachia kha thehoysah oh,” a cipya hae. Te ccungccaw zapi balyn nynh <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, mih minpaaw hae Pachia kha thehoysah hae zah <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> te siapharan malang khe bakhungte sawtuanaw a pya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Awkhualan khe <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kalan silawnaw rae hae zah, tangnuapaw thong kheit, tuutepaw thong kheit, tuutaw thong kheit khate maee-ute silawnaw kha raete, niapaw silawnaw ryte Israel hae balyn hanlan silawnaw patae a rae hae; <verse number="22" style="v" />tuin nin khe myarya lepaw lungpawnaw te <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> malang khe ae hae zah a neih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Siapharan lang Solomon Chitui Thuhnaw</para>
  <para style="p">David ccapaw Solomon kha siapharan lang vae ningnaw a khang hae; amaw kha <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kuihkaw e bawi lang chitui thuh hae zah, Zadok kha ranpibawi lang chitui a thuh hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tetuh Solomon tuh a paaw David ccelang siapharan lang tang zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kya-e bawitungkhung vawlan khe a haung; aning tuh a laan a sui ua zah Israel hae balyn nynh a bya a ngae hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:12">1Si 2.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v" />Cciakhaetu hae balyn te athungpaw rhawkaw hae, te David Siapharan ccapaw hae nynh mah Solomon Siapharan a uknaw zakaw um lan bya a kinku hae. <verse number="25" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh Israel hae balyn muihnaw khe Solomon kha myarya hang lang hangthung zah, langmawlya e Israel siapharan humhung sanmah a la pya boi lei hae paw siapharan huhan kha a pya.</para>
  <para style="s1">David Uknaw Adynnawte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesse ccapaw David nynh Israel ram pynpi kha a uk. <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel ram kha kum sung pali a uk; Hebron khua kya kum sari uk zah, Jerusalem khua kya sung thum kum thum a uk.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">2Sa 5.4-5</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:4">1Sh 3.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v" />David tuh myarya tawthya zah accyh azaw te, hoirumnaw te sawtuanaw ccoute a chih; te amaw ccelang a ccapaw Solomon nynh siapharan lang a tang. <verse number="29" style="v" />David Siapharan nynh a cyipaw kha atakaw te athangnaw cia profeh Samuel Ccauh, profeh Nathan ccauh te profeh Gad ccauh kya a zei hae, <verse number="30" style="v" />a uknaw kong balyn, a thungnaw te amaw tungvaw, Israel tungvaw te laephi vaw e peenaw balyn tungvaw kya acyihkuhpaw konglang balyn kha mah a zei hae.</para>
</usx>